<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">MARK Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mark dungjuiya chongkahoi hi</char> “Inzootna Kathar (NT)” suungnga kaom larik mili ngai karra Jisu Christa ringkhuo jarra inthiarra kanaminmu larik inkhat kha eii. Larik mili ngaikha “Gospel” tia injetna, hiwa tinachu “Chongkahoi” tina eii. Hiwa larik mili ngaihi Jisu Christa athisuo nuk-ah Matthew, Mark, Luke khat-um John in inmajia eii. Mark dungjuiya chongkahoi hi larik mili ngai karra akabongkhet larik kha eii. Hiwa larik hi Gospel inti larik mili ngai karra mansakhet ah inmajia larik eii tia ngamna innei, hiwa larik hi Jisu Christa inneisuo nuk kum soomruk leira-nga li soom sari (65-70) kongkarra inmajia eii. Kasing kathei katam tak-in hiwa larik hi Rome ma kaom christian ngaikha masok nasik ah Rome makheiya inmajia larik eii tia ngamna innei.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mark</char> hi John Mark tia-um injetna, amahi tirton Paul li Barnabas le inruoi suomma chuon katho inkhat eii, takkha Pathian chongkaril chuonna (missionary chuonna) Paul li Barnabas kha leijui matormak jarra ama ramingkha aleithi (Chuon 13:13). Takkha nuk achu Barnabas le inruoi suomma sina inleinei (Chuon 15:37-39). Mark hi Peter le inlopthei sap inkhat in-eii tia ngamna innei (1 Pet 5:13). Mark hi Jisu ringkhuo ngaihi amit tak-ah kamu miring kha emak innum, Mark in Peter imu ijet ngaikha katamtak amajia-ah Mark dungjuiya chongkahoi hi aleida. Hiwa larik hin, Mark in siamruoi ringkhuo khat-um Jisu in ahekna nikhuo jarra iminchu ngaikha tam amajia.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mark in hiwa larik jarra malarna chong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Jisu'n Galilee ah leiomlai ileitho chuon ngai jarra Mark in rilthiarna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1:14–8:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Jisu'n Jerusalemma isi jarra Mark in rilna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8:22–10:52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Jisu'n Jerusalemma omlai khat-um Jisu thina li ahongring nookna jarra amajia-ah Mark in minhekna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:8">11:1–16:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">John Baptist Chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Hiwahi Pathian Sapa Jisu Christa jarra chongkahoi ngaikha eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu injiamak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian Sapa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah larik-ah imajia angnga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Pathian aleiti ‘Kei'n nang ma-ah kachongkachoi inkhat kajuotirsik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ama'n nang sik-ah lam aboolsik eii.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Neelramma kheek rasa inkhat khachu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Pumi sik-ah lamkha booltaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Ama lamkha mintuunru.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Khawa jarra John in neelramma aheisuok-ah, baptize ithole inruoiya Pathian chong aleiril.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">John in neelramma aheisuok-ah, baptize ithole inruoiya Pathian chong aleiril. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu hintia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Baptist John neelramma aheisuok-ah Pathian chong aleiril.</char></note> “Ningmanu-ah inphut heikir inlang baptize thoru” halli “Ningmanu rakip Pathian in anara-ngaidam pisik eii,” Ama'n mipuidiang aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />John chongril kara-ngai sik-ah Jerusalem khuopui khat-um Judea ramsuungnga kaom mipui katamtak inheisuok. Inmani'n inmanu ngai inrilsuok halli ama'n Jordan tuidung suungnga inmani ngaikha baptize aleimintho.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />John in salaileem mulla inbool puondiar aleitho, akhoongnga sawun koongkhit aleikhit, ama bak-inchu khai khat-um ramkhuoining alei eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Reng 1:8</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ama'n mipuidiang aleirilla ati, “Kei kanuk-ah akajuosik miringpa khachu kei neek-ah akaloksik eii. Keichu ama kekokrui kuunli kasuutsik kha-um rahoi suokmong <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Kei'n tuiya baptize kanatho, takkha ama inchu Ratha Inthiangnga baptize anathosik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Baptize thonale Matheemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matt 3:13–4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Khawasuoli sootlekleiya Jisu'n Galilee ramsuungnga kaom Nazareth khuopui makheiya inphut aheiwa halli John in Jordan tuidung suungnga baptize aleitho. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jisu'n tuiya inphut hongsuokli, Ama'n marwaan suongkot inlong khat-um Ratha in achungnga Wathu angnga ijuochum kha aleimu.<verse eid="MRK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Khat-um marwaanna inphut rasa inkhat ajuoa, “Nanghi kinaminriang tak kasapa kha na-eii. Nachungnga kamalung atai.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Inphut 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Matt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mk 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:27">Luk 3:27</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Khawasuoli Ratha'n ama kha neelramma aleiruoi.<verse eid="MRK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Khawa munkhan nisoommili, Seitan in aleimatheem. Ramsa ngaile khawa khan inleiom, takkha marwaan tirton ngai'n ama sanna inleinei.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngakasur Miring mili Jisu'n akoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matt 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luk 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />John mikhumna suungnga indasuonuk, Jisu'n Galileeya asiya halli Pathian diangnga kajuo chongkahoi ngaikha aleiril.<verse eid="MRK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />“Apha kha ajuotungjei,” “Khat-um Pathian Rengram kha anaijei! Ningmanu-ah inphut malung thuul inlang chongkahoihi ngamnaru,” ama'n aleiti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Matt 3:2</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Jisu'n Galilee tuidiilpang ajuiya aheisuokli, ama'n ngakasur miring inni, Simon khat-um anai Andrew, leenna nga insur aleimu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Heiwaru kanuk najuiru, mi kasur namin-ekate.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Khawapha takkhan inleen inda-ah inmani ngaikha amale inruoiya inleisi.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ama'n asidetli unai inni, Zebedee sangai, James li John aleimu. Inmani'n rakuongnga inleen ngaikha worthanasik inleibool. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Jisu'n inmani amuli amumak, inmani aleikoi; khawa khan inmani'n inloom ruoingai khat-um inpa Zebedee kha rakuong suungnga inda-ah Jisu nukkha inleijui.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ratha Kathamak kaluut Miring inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Jisu le asiamruoi ngai'n Capernaum khuopuiya inheiwa, halli Jisu'n akahong Jihudi ngai sernikhuo khan Synagogue-ah asiya aleiminchu.<verse eid="MRK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ama minchuna kha akajet mipui rakip in inleingak, ajarchu ama kha Dan Karu ngaile lei-in-angmak, khawa rathuulla, Ama'n thomatornale inruoiya aleiminchu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Matt 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Khawapha takkhan ratha kathamak kaluut miringkhat Synagogue-ah aheiluut halli rasa inringnga aleikheek. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Angme keini diangnga nimanuom, Nazareth Jisu? Keini kanaminmangsik hin nijuobe? Kei'n nang kanajet, nangchu inthiang Pathian tirton kha na-eii!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jisu'n ratha diang chong aleipeii, “Omchianro, halli mipa diangnga inphut heisuokro!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ratha kathamak khan mipa kha kanatak-ah aleikanik, halli inringnga akheek-ah mipa diangnga inphut aheisuokjei. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Mipui ngaikhan inleingak, khawakhan inmani inkhatli inkhat in inleiti, “Hiwahi angmejei? Chongminchu kathar khabe? Hiwa mipa'n ranak kanei tak-ah ratha kathamak diang chong apeii, halli inmani'n achong injui!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Hinthoa, Jisu chongngaihi innot tak-ah Galilee rampumpuiya alei-inthang.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi katamtak amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matt 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngai'n James khat-um John le inruoiya, Synagogue inmathaanna Simon li Andrew ngai inntiang inleisi. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Simon tarpi kha ritun in athoa zaalmunna aleizaal, Jisu aheitungli, akananu jarra ama diang inleirilpi. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ama'n akananu diang asiya, akut-ah numeisanu kha aleikatook-ah aleikeithei. Ritun in ama kha amathaanjei, halli numeisanu khan inmani sepa aleitho.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Kani tasuo kholei phakhan, mipui ngai'n akana khat-um raikhuo kaluut rakip ngaikha Jisu diang inheiruoi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Khawa khuopuiya kaom mipui ngaikha khawa inn makhan inlei-inchun. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jisu'n rirai rakip-ah kana katamtak ngaikha aleimindam khat-um raikhuo katamtak aleipuutsuok. Raikhuo ngai'n ama kha tume ti inleijet, khawa jarra Ama'n inmani ngaikha iteii leiminrilmak.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galileeya Jisu Chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ziingtiang kani suokma-ah, Jisu'n intheiya inn kha amathaanjei. Khuopui kha amathaanna mirasa neimakna munkhattiang aleisi, khawa munkhan ama'n Pathian aleini. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Takkha Simon khat-um asappui ngai'n insuok-ah ama kha inleiratok, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />halli inmani'n ama injuomu phakhan, inti, “Mirakip in nangkha innaratok.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Takkha Jisu'n aleimasang, “Hiwa hinna inphut eini'n khuo inkhattiang nisisik eii. Inmani diang-um kei chong kalarilsik eii, ajarchu khawa sik-ah kei kijuo eii.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Khawa jarra ama'n Galilee rampumpui suungnga aleisi, Synagogue-ah chong aleiril halli raikhuo ngai aleipuutsuok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Matt 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Miringkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matt 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Akaphar miring inkhat in Jisu diang ahongnga, kemurkhup thep-ah, halli nasanro tia nina aleinei. “Nang in nazoot inchu,” “Kei namindamro,” ama'n aleiti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kei naminthiang ro: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiwa kanahi inmani ngai sina dungjuiya inthiang mak manukaroon mikhat ah inlei.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jisu diang minriang kha aleisip, halli “Kei'n kanamindam zoot,” tia aleimasang, “Kadam kha etaro” tia akut aduongnga aleikatook! <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Khawapha takkhan akaphar kha ama diangnga inphut asuok-ah halli ama kanakha adamjei. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Khawa makheiya Jisu'n chong ka-ngar kha ama diang arilla ama kha aleiminsi.<verse eid="MRK 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Rangairo, hiwa jarhi tu inkhat diang-um rilpimaro, takkha si-inlang Thiampu diang nang juo-inmuro; khawa khan mirakip in nangkha nadamjei ti innajet nasik-ah, Moses chongpeii dungjuiya inmani diang pesik kasuok phurpeii kha juo inpero,” tia ama kha aleiminsi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levi 14:1-32</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Takkha ama'n asuok-ah amun rakip-ah akasuok chongngai kha aleirilsuok. Inthiangnga, Jisu jarra ama'n chongkatamtak aleiril jarra Jisu'n mipui omna khuopui khan leisuok matormakjei. Khawa rathuulla ama'n mirasa neimakna mun ngaikhan aleiom, khat-um amun rakip-ah kaom mipui ngai'n ama koolla inheiwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Apang kathi Mi inkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matt 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nikhuo lekkhat suoa Jisu'n Capernaum tiang aleikirnook, khat-um innkhan ama omjei iti chong alei-inthang. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Khawa jarra mipui katamtak ngaikha inheiwa-ah khawakhan tungnasik mun karuok leiommak, suongkotkuung kha-um leiruokmak, halli Jisu'n inmani diang Pathian chongkha aleirilpi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Miring mili khat-in Jisu diang apang kathi mi inkhat inhongruoi pha, <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />mipui ngaikhan ajar-eya, miring pakha ama koolla heiluutpui matormu, khawa jarra inmani'n Jisu omnachei chungkhum inphongnga, mipakha azaalna pherle inruoiya injuomachum. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Inmani ngamna amupha, Jisu'n apang kathi mipa diang aleiti, “Kasapa, namanu ngaikha kanarangaidam suojei.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Dan Karu lekkhat in khawa khan inlei in-ongnga inmalungnga inleingaidon, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ama'n angsik-ah hinna itime? Hiwa hichu Pathian chungnga irilse eii! Pathian amabit eii manu rakip kangaidam matorchu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Jisu'n inmani malung ngaidon ajet-ah, inmani diang aleiti, “Angsikme khawa ka-angngai ningngaidon? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Apang kathi mipa diang, ‘namanu ngai kanarangaidam pijei,’ ti emakli, inthei inlang, napher ruut inlang siro tihi hume kabei? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kei'n nangni diang narilcheenpi kate, khachu, Miring Sapa'n nuoipil chungnga manu rakip ka-ngaidam sik ranak anei.” Khawa jarra apang kathipa diang ati, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Kei'n nangdiang kati, intheiro, napher ruut inlang, na-inna sitro!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Inmani'n in-enna inomlaitak, mipakha intheiya, apher kha aruut-ah innot-ah aleisuok, halli inmani rakip in inleingak-ah Pathian inminpaak-ah, “Hiwa ka-ang ngaihi suplamu lamumakmi inleiti!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Levi akoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matt 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jisu'n woikhat Galilee tuidiil pangtiang ahongkir nookpha, mipui katamtak amadiang inheiwa, halli ama'n inmani kha aleiminchu. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ama'n asina lamma, rampar kakhoom, Alphaeus sapa Levi, ama rampar teelna munna in-ongkha aleimu. Jisu'n amadiang, “Kanuk najuiro,” aleiti. Halli Levi'n intheiya anuk aleijui.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Khawasuoa Jisu'n Levi inna bu aleibak. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi inna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kha emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(khachu Jisu) inn.</char></note> Rampar kakhoom katamtak ngaile, manukaroon ngai'n Jisu nuk inleijui, hanna inmani katam khatchu Jisu li asiamruoi ngai bubakna khan inlei-inchel. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Pharisee um ka-eii Dan Karu lekkhat in, manukaroon khat-um rampar kakhoom ngaile Jisu'n ibak suomkha inleimu, khawa jarra ama siamruoi ngaidiang inmani'n inleirakel, “Angsikme ama'n hiwa mi ngaile ibak suomhi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jisu'n hiwa ajet-ah inmani diang aleimasang, “Tu ka-ang akadam ngaisikchu kathiam rangaimak, takkha akana mi sikchu arangai. Kei'n kijuo hichu akadik mi ngai kakoi kijuo emong, takkha manukaroon ngai kakoi kijuo eii.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bak-in Ngeijarra chongrakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matt 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />John Baptist nukkajui ngaili pharisee ngai'n bu-ngei nikhuo khan bu inleingei. Mi lekkhat in Jisu diang inhongnga inhongrakel, “Angtia John Baptist siamruoi ngaili Pharisee siamruoi ngai'n bu inngeili, nasiamruoi ngaichu inngeimak?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Moiruoina munna Moipa omlaiseng asap ngaikha bak-in inngeiya inomsik eii tia ningngaidonbe? khawakha emak! moipa inmanile omlaiseng chu, bak-in leiya omnunu. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Takkha moipa kha inmani diangnga inphut inlaruoi nasik nikhuo alajuosik eii, khawa phakhan inmani bu inla-ngeisik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Tu inkhatbit innum puon katharkha neiman inlang puonmaruo chungnga phoudelmu, ajarchu akathar inphoukhan amaruokha kheella keiriinta achetna ahonglokpui detsik eii. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Tu innum theibomju kathar kha sawuntuong maruo ngaikhan thunngaimu, ajarchu amaruo sawuntuong khan theibomju kha aminmang, khat-um sawuntuongli theibomju inniya inmangsuomsik eii. Khawa rathuulla, theibomju kathar kha akathar sawuntuongnga inthunsik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sabbath jarra Chongrakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matt 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Jihudi ngai Sernikhuo khan Jisu'n gehu billa aleisi. Asiamruoi ngai'n amale inheiwa phakhan, gehu wuuikha inleichin. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Khawa jarra Pharisee ngai'n Jisu diang inleiti, “Enro, Sernikhuoni nasiamruoi ngai ithohi eini Sinadan izootmak ngaikha eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Innidan 23:25</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “David khat-um ama mi ngai'n inwon champha, ama'n baksik ommakpha angme ileitho nangni lateel makchube?<verse eid="MRK 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ama'n Pathian inna aluut-ah halli Pathian diangnga inpe waipool kha aleibak. Hiwahi Abiathar in Thiampu Kaliankhet achanglai khan aleisuok. Eini Sinadan dungjuiya chu Thiampu ngai bit-in ibakngaikha David in aleibak, halli ama mi ngaidiang-um aleipeii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levi 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Halli Jisu'n ahekna-ah ati, “Sernikhuo hichu miringngai thanasik-ah inbool eii; Sernikhuo sik-ah miring ngaihi inbool emak. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Khawa jarra miring sapa hi Sernikhuo Pumi kha-um eii.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kut Kathi Miring inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matt 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Khawasuo Jisu'n Synagogue-ah aleikirnook, khawakhan akut kathi miring inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Jisu diang noonnasik ithosial ombe tia athang suonasik kamanuom mi lekkhat khawakhan in-enna inleiom; khawa jarra inmani'n Sernikhuo khan ama'n miring pakha amindambe tia katha-ah inlei-ensui. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jisu'n kanapa diang aleiti, “Matianghin hongkalro.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Halli Ama'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Sernikhuo khan eini Sinadan in ang thocha atime? sansik emakli minmang sikbe? Tu ka-ang khat ringkhuo sansik emakli minmangsik hibe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Takkha inmani'n iteii leirilmu. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jisu'n amit kalek-ah inmani diang alei-enna aleiraang, inmani malung kangar khat-um inthamak jarra aleipoongpui. Khawasuoli ama'n mipa diangkhan aleiti, “Nakut keisuoro.” Ama'n akut aheikeisuo, halli akutkha aleidam. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Khawasuo Pharisee ngai'n Synagogue inmathaanna inleisi; halli Herod mi ngaile innot-ah in-inmuwa, inmani'n Jisu thatnasik chuon inleiminsuuk.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuidiil pangnga Mipui ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaile Galilee tuidiiltiang inleisi, Galileeya inphut mipui katamtak in anuk inleijui, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Judea ramma, Jerusalemma, Idumea ramma, Jordan raaltiangnga kaom ram, khat-um Tyre le Sidon rampumpuiya mi katamtak in Jisu itho ngaikha injet-ah amadiang inheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Mipui intamhei jarra ama in-uum maknasik Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang rakuong inkhat amasik minteiru aleitipi. Jisu sik asiamruoi ngai'n rakuong inleimintei. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ama'n mi katamtak aleimindam, khat-um akana rakip in ama katooknasik ama omnatiang inlei-inneng. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ratha kathamak kanei mirakip in ama inmu phakhan, inmani'n amaikuungnga inleipur khat-um inringnga inleikheek, “Nangchu Pathian Sapa kha na-eii!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Jisu'n ratha kathamak ipuutpi inmani ngaidiang ama tutakme tihi tu inkhatdiang tipimaru tia chong kanatak aleipeii.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Tirton Soomleini kadang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matt 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Jisu'n ching inkhat akalla halli ama'n imanuom mi ngaikha aleikoi. Inmani'n amadiang inheiwa, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />han ama'n soomleini ngaikha amale inruoisik khat-um chongkaril sik-ah aleikadangnga “Tirton tia aleikoi, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />khat-um raikhuo ngai puutsuok nasik ranak aleipeii.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Hiwa senghi ikadang soomleini ngaikha in-eii: Simon (Peter tia Jisu'n araming aphuo); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />James li anai John, Zebedee sangai (Jisu'n Boanerges tia araming aleiphuo, hiwa tinachu “Ruokinri sapa ngai” tina eii); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus sapa James, Thaddaeus, Simon Patriot, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Halli Judas Iscariot, Jisu kajuorpa, hiwa ngaihi in-eii.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matt 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Khawa suoli Jisu'n inntiang aleikir. Woikhat-um khawa ka-ang akatam mipui inchun nook-ah Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngaikha bubaknasik pha leimumu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ama insuung mi ngai'n hiwachong injetpha, inmani'n amakha ruoinasik inleitho, ajarchu inmani'n inleiti, “Amahi inweetjei!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Jerusalem tiangnga kahong Dan Karu lekkhat ngai'n, “Ama suungnga Beelzebul om! raikhuo ngai lamkakeipa khan amadiang ranak apeya halli inmani iminpuutsuok eii,” inleiti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Matt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n inmani ngaikha akoolla koiya, inmani diang chongminkhi ngaikha aleirilpi: “Angtho thoa Seitan in Seitan apuutsuok sikme? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Rengram inkhat in inthenkhoiya rupni insuok inchu inkhatli inkhat insuol inta, khawa rengram kha akoisik eii. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Insuungkhur inkhat inthenkhoiya rupni insuok inchu inkhatli inkhat insuol inta, khawa insuungkhur kha akoisik eii. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Khawa jarra Seitan rengram hi rupni suok ah inthenkhoi inchu, khawa kha sootnuni, takkha alek alek-ah koita amang wiaksik eii.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Tu inkhat innum aka-ngar mipa kha akhitmasa-ah adamak inchu, a-inn luut-ah aneinaak rakip kha leimator nuni.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Inthiangnga kei'n nangni diang kitihi eii, khachu mi ngai manu rakip khat-um inrilse angjet leiom innum angaidam pisik eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:28. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inrilse angjet leiom; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian chungnga karilse ngaikha.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Takkha tu e-innum Ratha Inthiang chungnga karilse ngaikha angtikniteii ngaidam pinuni, ajarchu ama'n hektik kaboi manu kha athojei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />“Ama suungnga ratha kathamak kha aom” mi lekkhat in inti jarra, Jisu'n hiwahi aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Anu li Anai ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matt 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Khawa suoli Jisu anu le anai ngai inhongtung jei. Inmani'n inntuolla inngirra amadiang chong inminsiya ama inleikoi. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Jisu koolla mipui katamtak inlei in-ong, halli inmani'n ama diang inleiti, “Enro, nanu le na-u nanai, nasar ngai'n tuolla nang inna inmupuizoot-ah inom.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Tume kei kanu? Tume kei ka-u kanai ngai?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ama koolla in-ong mipui ngaikha ahei-enna aleiti, “Enru! Hinna kaom ngaihi kei kanu khat-um kei ka-u kanai ngaikha in eii! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Tu e-innum Pathian lungdou katho ngaikha ka-u kanai, kanu khat-um kasar ngaikha in eii.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Muchi Kaworpa Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Inlet-ah Jisu'n Galilee tuidiil khamma minchuna aleiphut. Ama koolla hong-inchun mipui ngaikha inleitam, khawa jarra ama'n rakuong inkhat suungnga aluut-ah alei in-ong. Rakuong kha tuikhamma aleiom, khale inruoiya mipui ngai-um tuikham khan inleingir. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Ama'n chongminkhi katamtak aneimanna inmani ngaikha aleiminchu, halli inmani diang aleiti:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Rangairu! miring inkhat in muchiru kaworsik aheisuokjei. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ama'n leiya muchiru kha aheiwor pha, lekkhat in lamkoolla achul, halli wa ngai'n inheiwa-ah inruut. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Muchiru lekkhat in neipil toomna lungbil khan inchul. Muchiru kha innot-ah ahongmoong, ajarchu neipil kha lei-inthuukmak. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Halli kani ahongsuok pha, akadoong muchichiak ngaikha injuo charjei; ajarchu inrajung kha inthuuk-ah leisi matormak, muchichiak ngaikha innot-ah inleichar. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Muchiru lekkhat in raling karra inchul, inhongmoong takkha raling in aleidiip, halli inmani leikaramu. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Takkha muchiru lekkhatchu neipil hoina-ah inleichul, khat-um achiakngai khan inhongkek, inhong-insoon, khat-um inhongkara: lekkhat in soomthum, soomruk halli lekkhat in rajakhat inhongkara.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Halli Jisu'n ahekna-ah aleiti, “Akuor indou rakip in hiwahi rangairu!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongminkhi ngai Apena jar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matt 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luk 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Jisu'n atheinuoa aompha, ama siamruoi soomleini ngaile inruoiya ama jarra kajet ngai'n akoolla inheiwa halli chongminkhi ngaikha incheenna rilcheen nasik amadiang inleirakel. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />“Nangni diangchu Pathian Rengram jarra inthup rakip jetnasik kha anapejei,” tia Jisu'n aleimasang. “Takkha tu ka-ang tuolla kaom lekkhat ngaisikchu, chongminkhi hinna hiwa rakip ngaihi injetsik eii,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Khawa jarra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Inmani'n enchu en-inte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Takkha mununu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">inmani'n rangaichu rangai inte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Takkha jetnunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Kha intho innum, inmani Pathian diang inkir nooksik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">halli ama'n inmani ngaikha arangaidamsik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n muchi Kaworpa Chongminkhi irilthiar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Nangni'n hiwa chongminkhi hi jetmakchube? Kha e-inle, nangni'n chongminkhi rakip ngaihi angtho tholi ningjet sikme? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Muchi kaworpa khan Pathian chongkha awor. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Miring lekkhat khachu lamsirra kachul muchi ngaikhale in-ang; inmani'n khawa chongkha injetli injetmak, Seitan khan aheiwali achoideljei. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Miring lekkhat ngai'n lungkarra akata muchi khale in-ang. Inmani'n khawa chongkha injetli injetmak, karok tak-ah inleikeiluut. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Takkha inmani inrajung inthuuk-ah leisimu, khat-um inmani soot leideimatormu. Khawa chongkhan ajar-eya, poongraalna aheiwapha khanchu, inmani'n innot-ah mangna innei. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Miring lekkhat ngaikhan raling karra kachul muchi khale in-ang. Inmani ngaihi chong kajetjei ngaikha in-eii, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Takkha hiwa ringkhuo poongna ngai, inchong kamanuom, khat-um aleiilaak manuomna rakip ngaikhan, khawa chongkha inminmang, khawa jarra inmani karamu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Takkha miring lekkhat khachu neipil hoina munna inwor muchi khale in-ang. Inmani'n chongkha inrangai, inkeiluut, lekkhat in soomthum, soomruk, halli lekkhat in rajakhat inkara.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kok nuoiya Meiser</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Jisu'n aminchudel nook-ah, “Tu inkhat innum meiser heichoiya halli kok nuoiya emakli zaalmun nuoiya inda ngaiyabe? meiser kechungnga inda-ngai emak abe? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Lei inthup ngaikha lahong inlarsik eii, halli lei inkhu rakip ngaikha ala inlongsik eii. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Akuor indou rakip in hiwahi rangairu!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n ningjet ngaikhan insingtheiru. Nangni'n mi ngai chungnga chong ningtan angnga nangni diang-um Pathian in atansik eii, kheella atansik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:2">Matt 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk 6:38</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ajarchu akanei amadiang kheella apesik eii, han kaneimak amadiang ama inei lekteii kha-um aleidelsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Matt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref> </char><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahongkamoong Muchiya Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jisu'n aleiril, “Pathian Rengram khachu, miring inkhat in aleiya muchiru iwor khale in-ang. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ama'n zaanna azaal, suun eli inthei, halli khawa rathil muchiru ngaikhan inhongkek-ah inhongmoong. Hiwahi angtho tholi kasuokme iti ama'n leijetmak. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Neipil khan muchi chiak ngaikha minmoong halli inhongkara; mansakhet-ah inziik inhongsuok, halli inbor, ahekna-ah sawuui katha kha inkara.<verse eid="MRK 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Sawuui kha aminpha, mipa khan kooiteiiya saang karakhool aleiphut, ajarchu leirakhool phakha aheitungjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Jo 3:13</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anchamruwa Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matt 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luk 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />“Pathian Rengram hi angleme in-ang nitisik?” Jisu'n aleirakel. “Angkachang chongminkhi nineimanli nirilcheen sikme? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Khawa khachu, miring inkhat in manmasituolla, akasinkhet anchamru achoiya, neipilla iwor khale in-ang. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Apha lekkhat eli ahongmoong khat-um thingkuung ngai karra akalokkhet ahong eii. Khat-um abaak kalok ngai ahongsuok ah khawa ralikhan wa ngai'n inrabu inleiphan.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jisu'n ama chongkha mi ngaidiang aleiril, hiwa ka-ang chongminkhi katamtak ngaihi aneimanna; ama'n inmani diang injetmatorseng aleirilpi. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ama'n chongminkhi inchellekleiya inmani diang iteii inkhat-um leirilpimak, takkha ama asiamruoi ngaile inom phakhan, ama'n incheenna angrakip ngaikha inmani diang aleirilpi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Thipui amindai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matt 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Khawa nitak kholeitiang khan Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Eini tuidiil raalkhattiang khan rakaan inlang sirui.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Khawa jarra inmani'n mipui ngaikha inda-ah; asiamruoi ngai'n Jisu alei in-ongna rakuong khan inluut-ah, inmani'n ama kha inleiruoi. Rakuong lekkhat-um khawa munkhan inleiom. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Jetlei theileiya thipui kangar inkhat ahongraangnga, tuiphuksaan khan rakuong pangkha hongzeemma tuikaluut aleiphut, rakuong kha tui'n hongsipsik aleitho. <figure style="fig" alt="Suddenly strong wind blew" file="CN01707B.TIF" size="span" ref="4:37">Thipui ka-ngar khat-um tuiphuksaan khan rakuong pangkha ihongzeem</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jisu'n rakuong nuktiang khan, luthun aneiya aleizaal. Asiamruoi ngai'n ama inkeitheiya inleiti, “Karu, keini kathisik kin-ejei, keini sik-ah nang ngaidon makchebe?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jisu'n angirra thipui diangkhan chong aleipeii, “Omchianro!” halli ama'n tuiphuksaan diangkhan aleiti, “Daitaro!” Thipui kha ajuodai, halli khawakhan thipuikha ajuodaijei. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Angsik-ah nangni'n ningchime? Tuunkatung nangni ngamna laneimak chube?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Takkha kachi khan inmani diang asip-ah inkhatli inkhat diang inlei-inti, “Hiwa miring hi tume? thipui khat-um tuiphuksaan innum achong injuihi!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ratha Kathamak kaluut Mi inkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matt 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Jisu le asiamruoi ngai'n Gerasene ramsuungnga kaom, Galilee tuidiilpang khattiang inhongtung phakhan, <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jisu'n rakuongnga inphut ajuochumli chummak thaan billa inphut aheikasuok miring inkhat alei-intongpui. Hiwa miringpa suungnga ratha kathamak kha aleiom <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />khat-um thaanbilla aleiom. Tu inkhat innum amahi woini kahuuiya thirruiya khit-ah damatormu; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Akutli akeii ngaihi inleikhit, takkha inleikhit racham thirrui kha aleimachat halli thirkha akeiiya aleitouthaak. Tu inkhat innum innuoiya leidamatormu ajarchu ama ranak ngar. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ama'n suunli zaan boiya thaanbil kha akuoitong halli chingnga aleiloon, akheek-ah atheinuo-ah lungnga alei-insukchat.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ama'n Jisu kha kalaak-ah aleimu; halli ama'n aheitanna, Jisu maikuungnga kemurkhup thep-ah chubei ajuotho, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />halli rasa inringnga akheek-ah aleiti, “Jisu, Insaangkhet Pathian Sapa! Angme keidiang nimanuom? Kei'n Pathian ramingnga kanani, kei naminpoong maro!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ama'n hiwahi aleiti ajarchu Jisu'n aleiti, “Ratha kathamak, hiwa mipa diangnga inphut heisuokro!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n amadiang aleirakel, “Naraming ang intime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Mipa khan aleimasang, “Kei karaming chu ‘akatam inti’ ajarchu keini kintam!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Halli ama'n Jisu diang ratha kathamak ngaihi khawa ramma inphut napuutpi maro tia inlet inlet-ah aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Khawakhan wok rahooi yam chingthut khan inbak-ah inleiom. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Khawa jarra ratha ngaikhan Jisu diang inleiti, “Wok ngaidiang khan natirru, halli keini'n inmani suungnga luutkinte.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ama'n inmani ngaikha aleiminsi, halli mipa diangnga inphut ratha kathamak ngaikha insuok-ah wokngai suungnga inleiluut. Wok rahooi sengkha Wok lising inni in-eii, inraya-ah suktaaktiang sumpalingkhang intho-ah khat-um tuidiil khan inta-ah inleithi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wok kakhaal ngaikhan intaanna halli khuopuiya khat-um khuo khuo-ah kaom mi ngaidiang chong ngaihi injuorilpi. Mipui ngaikhan akasuok omchan kha ka-ensik inheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Khat-um Jisu diang inmani'n inheiwa phakhan, inmani'n raikhuo katam kaluutpa kha, puondiar thoa malungron katha roonna; in-ongnga ileiom kha inleimu, halli inmani rakip in amakha inleichi. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Raikhuo kaluutpa khat-um wok ngaidiang aleikasuok rakip kamu ngai'n mipui diangkhan inleirilpi.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Khawa suoli inmani'n Jisu diang inmani ramkha mathaan inlang sitro inleiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Jisu'n rakuong suungnga aluut phakhan, raikhuo kaluut miringpa'n ama diang aleini, “Kei-um nangle sisuomkate!”<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Takkha Jisu'n leizootpimak. Khawa rathuulla, amadiang aleiti, “Nang inntiang kir-inlang na-innsuung mi ngaidiang angtuk-ah Pumi Pathian in nang sik-ah inathopi khat-um inaminriang kha rilpiro.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Khawa jarra ama'n khawa munkha amathaanna Khuopui Soom inti ram (Decapolis) arakaanna, Jisu'n ama sik-ah ileithopi ngaikha aleiril. Halli khawa kajet rakip ngai'n inleingak.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jairus Sanu khat-um Jisu Puonmor Kakatooknu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matt 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jisu'n tuidiilpang raaltiang arakaanna aleikir. Khawa tuidiil pangkhan mipui katamtak ama koolla inhei-inchun. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Jairus, khawa ramma Synagogue karoon inkhat aheitung, halli ama'n Jisu kha amupha, Jisu kekuungnga ajuo-inbok <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />khat-um malung kaluut-ah amadiang aleini, “Alakadoong kasanu kha natheiya om, naheiwapi inlang aring adamnasik nakut-ah najuokatook piro aleiti!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Halli Jisu'n amale inruoiya kasi inleiphut. Khawa jarra mipui katamtak in Jisu nuk injuiya amakha inlei-uum.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Khawakhan kumsoomleini thikasarra chikaom rirai karoon numeisa inkhat aleiom, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Kathiam angjet in akana numeisanu kha inlei-en. Ama sialsum rakip aleineiman suojei, takkha kadamsik rathuulla ina kha apha rakip-ah hongkheelsit. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Khawa numeisanu in Jisu athang ala aleijet-ah, ama nukkha mipui karra aheijui, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />khawa numeisanu khan atheinuo-ah inti, “Kei'n ama puonmor kakatook inchu, kei kadamsik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ama'n Jisu puonmor aleikatook, akatookli katookmak ama thikasar kha aleikhak; khawakhan ama'n atheinuo-ah kinahi kadamjei tia alei-injet. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Khawa phakhan Jisu'n ama diangnga aranak isuok kha ajet-ah, Ama'n mipui karra ahei-inlet-ah aleirakel, “Tume kei kapuon kakatook?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n inleimasang, “Mipui'n nang inna-uumhi namu; angjarra nang in tume kei kanakatook nitime?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Takkha Jisu'n tu ithome jetsik tia asir apang alei-en. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Numeisanu khan ama diangnga kasuok kha aleijet, khawa jarra kachi khat-um intuulle inruoiya aheiwa-ah Jisu kekuungnga ajuo-inbok, halli akadik rakip kha ama diang aleirilpi. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Kasanu, nang ngamna khan nang nadamjei. Kahoi kadaiya sitro, halli napoongna makheiya kadam kha etro.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Hiwahi Jisu'n atilai takkhan, lamkakei Jairus inna inphut chongkachoi lekkhat inhongnga Jairus diang inhongti, “Nasanu kha athijei. Angsikme Karu kha nilakacher?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Angme inmani itikha Jisu'n leirangai pimak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:36. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">leirangai pimak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">leira-ngai pimak.</char></note>, takkha lamkakeipa diang aleiti, “Chimaro, ngamnabit ngamnaro.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Khanna inphutchu Peter, James halli anai John elekleiya tu inkhat-um anuk kajuisik-ah leizootpimakjei. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Inmani'n synagogue lamkakei Jairus inna inleitung, khawakhan Jisu'n thodan jetmuwa inkheek-ah khat-um inwaiya kachap ngaikha aleimu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ama'n innsuung aluut-ah inmani diang aleiti, “Angtia thodan ningjet makme? Angsik ame ningchap? Naipangnu hi akathi emak, takkha akazaal keeng!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Inmani'n ama kha inlei innuipui, khawa jarra ama'n inmani rakip tuolla aleiminsuok, asiamruoi inthumle khat-um naipangnu nuli pa aruoiya, naipangnu zaalnatiang khan inleiluut. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ama'n naipangnu kutkhan amahuumma aleiti, <char style="tl">“Talitha, Koum,” </char> tinachu, “Alakasiin naipangnu, kei'n kati nang intheitro!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Khawapha takkhan ama'n intheiya asi aleihong. (Numeisanu kha kum soomleini alei eii.) Hiwa inmupha khan, inmani'n inthiangnga inleingak. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Takkha Jisu'n tu diang-um rilpimaru tia chong kangar kha inmani diang aleipeii, halli ama'n aleiti, “Numeisanu diang baksik lekkhat peru.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nazereth ah Jisu Leizootmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matt 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jisu'n khawamun kha amathaanna ama khuopui tiang aleikirra ama siamruoi ngai'n inleijui. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Jihudi ngai Sernikhuoni Synagogue-ah ama'n kaminchu aleiphut, karangai mipui rakip in inleingak. “Inmani'n inleirakel, ama'n hingai rakip hi hunna ijetme?” angkachang lungsing lungwarme ama diang inpehi? Angtho thowa inlak choun ithotheime? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ama hi emak abe thingchounna akut kathei, Mary sapa, halli James, Joseph, Judas, khat-um Simon u-pa kha? Ama nainu ngai kha-um hiwaram hin einile ommuwabe? Halli inmani ngai'n ama kha leizootmu.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiril, “Pathian chongkachoi ngaihi inmani insuungkhurra khat-um in-u innai ngai inchu khoya thona neimu takkha ruongraal achu khoya thona innei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Khawa khan Jisu'n mikana lekkhat diang akut duongnga imindam eleiya inlakchoun inkhat-um leitho matormak. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Mipui'n ngamna leineimu jarra, Jisu'n aleingak.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Jisu'n ama Siamruoi Soomleini ngai tirna.</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matt 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Khawa suoli Jisu'n asiya sirpangnga kaom khuo ngaidiang aleiminchu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Halli ama siamruoi soomleini ngaikha akoolla akoichunna inni inniya aleitir. Jisu'n ratha kathamakngai mator nasik-ah ranak aleipeii. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Khat-um ama'n chong aleiminchu, “Nangni'n chuon ningsipha khan kherol eleiya iteii choithei nutun, waipool, sial halli sialkok inkhat-um choimaru. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Puondiar inliak choimaru takkha hureikhaang khabit chuongru.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ama'n inmani diang aleitipi, hun e-innum innadonna inn khan omru, amunkha ningmathaan maklaiseng. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Hun e-innum ningsina khuopui khan mi ngai'n nangni kha innaleidonmak inchu, khat-um ningchongril kha inna rangaipimak inchu, nakeiiya kaom rahutkha kathing inlang leidaro, khawa tinachu inmanidiang chongmakhaina nileida kha eii.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Khawa suoli inmani'n inleisuok-ah mipui malung thuulna sik-ah chong inleiril. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Inmani'n raikhuo angjet puutsuokna inleinei, halli akana mi angjet olive sariak inleikanoot-ah inleimindam.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist inthatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matt 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Khawa phakhan Herod rengpa'n hiwarakip<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galilee karoonpa.</char></note> jarra aleijet, ajarchu Jisu raming kha amun rakip-ah inleirilthang. Mi lekkhat in inti, “John Baptist kha ahongringnookjei! khawa jarra ama'n hiwa inlakchuon ngaihi ithomator eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Matt 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref> </char><verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Mi lekkhat in inleiti, “Amahi Elijah eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Mi lekkhat in intirit, amahi Pathian chongkachoi eii, emakli tiallaiya Pathian chongkachoi ngai karra inkhat ka-ang eii.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herod in hiwahi ajet phakhan, ama'n aleiti, “Amahi John Baptist eii, kei'n ariing kitanpa kha eii, takkha kathi makheiya kahong ringnook ejei!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Herod, ama tak-in John Baptist surnasik-ah chongpena aleinei khat-um aminsurra John kha thirruiya inkhuop-ah mikhumna khan aleida. Herod in hiwa athona ajarchu anaipa Philip numei ineinu Herodias jarra eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />John Baptist in Herod diang leitipi kachak, “Nanaipa numeitak neisikkha Sinadan kha emak!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Han Herodias in John kha lei-enzootmak ama kha aleithatzoot, takkha Herod in ajar-eya Herodias in John kha leithat matormak, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Herod in John kha aleichi, ajarchu ama'n John kha mikathali inthiang inkhat eii tihi aleijet, Herod in John chongril arangai phakhan amalung aleipoong kha e-innum ama chongril kha alei rangaizoot, khawa jarra ama kha katha tak-ah aleida.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Hekna-ah Herodias in aphakacha aleimu, khachu Herod inneina nikhuo bubakni khan, kalok Kalian, waikaroon ngai, raalmi kalok ngai, halli Galilee khuopui lamkakei ngai koolla,<verse eid="MRK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Herodias sanu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herodias ngai sanu.</char></note>aheiluut-ah ajuolaam, halli Herod khat-um ama sappui ngaikha ajuominrok halli Rengpa'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Angme nang in nimanuom? kei'n nang imanuomrei kanapesik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Halli ama'n chong inkhitna khomak insaamma aleiti, “Nang in ninani takkha kanapesik eii, karengram herkhat e-innum.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Khawa jarra ama'n asuok-ah anudiang ajuorakel, “Angtakme kei'n kanisik?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Anu'n aleimasang, “John Baptist lu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Numeisanu khan innottheiya aheikir nook-ah Rengpa diang ajuoni, “Kei'n hiwamun cheihin khat-um atuuntak hin John Baptist lu kha sumkheengnga kamanuom!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Hiwa chong in Rengpa malung kha aleiminpoongthei, takkha in-ongpui ngai maikuungnga achong inkhit nakhan ajar-eya, numeisanu chongkha leikheet matormak, <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />khawa jarra ama'n innot tak-ah kangaak raalmi inkhat diang John lu kha heichoinasik chong aleipeii, kangaakpa khan khawa mun amathaanna mikhumna tiang aleisiya John lu kha aleitanna, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />sumkheeng chungnga ada-ah numeisanu diang aleipeii halli khawa numeisanu khan anudiang ajuopeii. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Hiwa chonghi injet phakhan ama siamruoi ngai'n inheiwa-ah akaluong kha inleiya inleiphuum.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi Lising Ra-nga awai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Tirton ngaikhan inheikirra Jisu le inlei-inmu, halli inmani ngai'n inchuontholi, minchuna ngaikha inleirilpi. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Khawa khan mi katamtak inluut insuok-ah inleiom, Jisu li ama siamruoi ngaikha bubaknapha leimumu, khawa jarra ama'n inmani diang aleitipi, “Hiwa hinna inphut suok-inlang adaina munna si-inlang soong jomachumrui.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Khawale inruoiya inmani'n khawamun makheiya suokna inleineiya rakuong inchuongnga adaina munkhan inleisi.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mi katamtak in inmani kasikha inleimu, tu-ngaime itihi inleijet phakhan, inmani ngai'n khuopuisuung inmathaanna Jisu li ama siamruoi ngai tungnasik munkhan inmani'n inleitung masa.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jisu'n rakuong makheiya aheisuokli mi katamtak aleimu phakhan amalungnga inmani ngaikha aleiminriang, ajarchu inmani ngaikha kakhaal kaboi Keelngamle in-ang, khawa jarra Jisu'n minchuna katamtak aleiminchu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Teelna 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Reng 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Khang 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezek 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Matt 9:36</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kholei heiluut phakhan, ama siamruoi ngai'n inheiwa-ah amadiang injuoti, “Tuunhin inmotheijei hiwa munhi ramchik eii. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mipui ngaihi minsi inlang, inmani'n anaina khuosuung emakli leiya sisuo inlang inbaksik juo-inchorasu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nangni'n inmani diang baksik peru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Amadiang inleirakel, “ Keini'n kinsili dangka pum rajani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dangka pum inkhat hi khuo-ah kaom mi ngai nisokhat chuon thoman eii.</char></note> hin waipool kinrachopili inmani kinminbak sikhi nang in namanuombe?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jisu'n inmani diang aheirakel, “Waipool angjet ningneime? si inlang juo-enru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Asiamruoi ngai'n inleimu phakhan, ama diang inleiti, “Waipool ra-ngali nga inni om.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Jisu'n ama siamruoi ngaidiang aleitipi mi rakip ngaikha rup rup-ah khoithen inlang chinthou bilkhan min-ongru. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Khale inruoiya mi rakip in inhei in-ong taangnga bukkhat-ah mi rajakhat, bukkhat-ah mi soomra-nga. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Khawa suoli Jisu'n waipool ra-nga khali nga inni kha aleiya marwaan tiang enna Pathian minpaakna aleinei. Ama'n waipool kha akatherli asiamruoi ngaidiang mi rakipdiang sempisik-ah aleipeii. Khale inruoiya ama'n nga inni kha-um akatherra inmani ngaidiang aleisempi <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Mipui'n bakna inneiya, inwon inleiminsip. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n akaliam waipool li nga kha kokwar soomleini inleikhoomtuup. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Akabak mi ngaikha pasalseng lising ra-nga inlei eii.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Tuichungnga isi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matt 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Jisu'n innottheiya ama siamruoi ngaikha rakuongnga aminluut-ah Bethsaida tiang ama neek-ah ma minsa-ah aleiminsi, khawa phakhan Jisu'n mipui kha-um aleiminsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Inmani rakip kha inthenpui suoli, ama'n chingmuolla Pathian kani aleisi. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kholei ephakhan, rakuong kha tuipui laikhan aleiom, Jisu kha atheinuo-ah muongpangnga aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ama'n siamruoi ngai poongna kha aleimu, ajarchu thikaraang kangar kha inlei intongpui; khat-um ziingtiang phadan inthum makheiya kuruk kongkarra Jisu'n tuichungnga inmanidiang aheiwa ah ama'n inmani kha aheikheel dengphakhan, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ama'n tuipui chungnga akeiiya iheiwa inmupha khan, inmani'n akathamak raikhuo eii intia inleikheek. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Inmani'n inleimu phakhan inraya-ah inlei-inlai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Takkha khawapha takkhan Jisu'n aleiti, “Malung minpoongmaru.” “Chimaru, Kei ka-eii!”<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Halli ama'n inmani rakuong suungnga aleiluut, khale inruoiya thikaraang kha aleidaijei. Halli asiamruoi ngai'n inthiangnga inleingak. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ajarchu inmani malung ngarjarra, mi lising ra-nga awaina chuon inlak kha leijet matormu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Gennesaret-ah Kana ngaikha amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matt 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Inmani'n tuipui inleirakaanna Gennesaret ramtiang inheiwa phakhan rakuong kha muongpangnga inleida. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Inmani'n rakuong makheiya inheisuok phakhan Jisu kha mipui'n ameel inleijet. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Halli mipui ngai'n inleijet phakhan khawa muntiang inheitaanna inheiwa, halli mi kana ngaikha inheiruoiya pherra inleiminzaal. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Khawa suoli Jisu leengnamun rakip-ah, khuo ah, khuopuiya, leiya, phaisuungnga, mipui'n akana ngaikha mi inchunna tiang inheiruoiya akana rakip in apuonmorbit katook nasik inleini, halli akakatook mi rakip in inleidam.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Pirui Purui jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matt 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Jerusalem makheiya kaheiwa Pharisee lekkhat khat-um Sinadan Karu ngaikha Jisu koolla inlei-intuup. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ama siamruoi lekkhat in inkut rasuleiya bu inleibak kha inmani'n inleimu, hiwahi inmani Sinadanna inthiangmak eii, tichu inmani'n inkutkha Pharisee ngai'n mipuidiang inminchu angnga leirasumu.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ajarchu Pharisee khat-um Jihudi rakip in inkutkha katha-ah inrasumak laiseng bu kha leibakmu hiwahi inmani Pi le Pu ngai leiminchu Sinadan eii. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Inmani'n phai makheiya inheiracho phur rakip ngaikha rasuthiang masaleiya leibakmu. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">phai makheiya inheiracho phur rakip ngaikha rasuthiang masaleiya leibakmu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">phai makheiya inheikirli insuthiang masaleiya leibakmu.</char></note>Khale inruoiya inmani'n aleiilaak sinasik Dan angjet inleijui, khat-um akatha tak-ah rabing, beel, sumkheeng, zaalmun ngaihi inlei rasuthiang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat injiamak</char><char style="fq" closed="false">zaalmun ngai.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Pharisee khat-um Dan Karu ngai'n inheirakel, “Angjarrame nang nasiamruoi ngai'n Pirui Purui ngai Sinadan injuimak, halli kut rasuleiya bu inbak?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Isaiah ileiril kha angtuk kadikme nangni jarra! katha inleem nangni ning eii, tia hinthoa aleimajia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Hiwa mipui ngai'n keihi inmur bit-ah innakaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">takkha inmalung ngachu kei kadiang kalaak-ah inom.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Takkha inmani'n keihi innemna boiya chubei innatho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ajarchu inmani'n manmasi ngai lungdou nuoiya inminchu kha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Pathian Dan angnga inmani'n inngaidon!’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nangni'n Pathian chongpe nakha zootmakchuwa miring ngai minchuna kha ningjuijei.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni minchuna juitheinasik beiya ningsing theiya Pathian chongpehi ninglooijei.<verse eid="MRK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moses chongpe nakhan, ‘Nanu napa nakaya sik, halli nanu napa kathamak-ah narilse inchu, amakha thina inpesik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Suok 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Suok 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Levi 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Innidan 5:16</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Takkha nangni'n ningti, mi inkhat in apa emakli anudiang sansik kasouk sanleiya, nang in hinnati, hiwa hichu corban (tinachu, Pathian ta eii), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Inmani'n innu emakli inpa sansik kha minsan makchujei. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Hiwa ka-ang minchunahi ningjuiya Pathian chonghi ningmathaanjei, khale inruoiya hiwa ka-ang chuon angjet nangni'n ningtho.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inthiangmak Neinaak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matt 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n mipui ngai rakip kha ama koolla akoinook-ah aleitipi, “Rangairu nangni ngai rakip khat-um jetru. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Tuol makheiya miring suungnga kaluut phur khan mi naminchokmak, takkha miring suungnga inphut hongkasuok khan mi aminchok.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Kuor indou mi rakip in rangairu.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Jisu'n mipui kha aleimathaanli inn inkhat-ah aleiluut, halli asiamruoi ngai'n minkhina thurchi jarra rilcheen nasik inleirakel. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />“Nangni'n mi ngai neek-ah ning-am,” Jisu'n inmani diang aril, “Tuunkatung nangni lajetmakchube? putiangnga heikaluut phur ngaikhan mi minchok matormak itihi jetmakchube, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ajarchu ningwonna kaluutkha ningmalungnga kaluut emak, halli ningpum makheiya suoknooksik eii.” (Jisu'n aleiti, phur rakip baksik-ah inthiang eii.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Halli Jisu'n aleitipi, “Miringnga inphut heikasuok khan mi minchok. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Nangni malungsuung makheiya kasuok kathamak in anakeiruoi, omchan kathamak, inruup, mi kathat, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />zool-inthai, phamrai kase, kathamak rakip katho, maleisei karil, kara-ot, omchan kalurmak, mikathat, in-or, khat-um ka-am, <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />hingai rakip nangni suungnga kaheisuok eii halli nangni kanaminchok eii.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Numeisanu Ngamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matt 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Khawa munkha Jisu'n aleimathaanna Tyre li Sidon ramsuungnga aleisi, tuteii diang lei-inlar zootmak jarra innsuungnga aleiom, takkha ama'n inthupchei leimatormak. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Asanu ratha kathamak kaluut numeisa inkhat in Jisu jarra aleijet-ah, halli khawapha takkhan aheiwa-ah Jisu kekuungnga aleikinbok. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Numeisanu kha Phoenicia Syria ramma innei Zaatlop inkhat alei eii, ama'n asanu diang kaom raikhuo kha puutsuok nasik-ah Jisu diang aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Takkha Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Mansa khet-ah naipang ngaihi wonkasip ah bakdirasu, ajarchu naipang ngai baksik bu kha leili ui ngaidiang pesik hi dikmak!”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Numeisanu in aleimasang, “Karu,” adik, “Ui innum naipang ngai bakbang buramol khamtuol nuoiya kata ngaikha inbak.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Halli aman'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Nang in khawa nanaheimasang jarra, na-inntiang kirtaro raikhuo kha nasanu makheiya asuokjei!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Khawa numeisanu khan inntiang akirpha khan zaalmun chungnga kazaal naipangnu kha apumma kaom ratha kathamak kha aleisuokjei.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Kuorkaseet khat-um Chong Kasuokmak Miring inkhat imindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Khawa suoli Jisu'n Tyre ramsuung kha aleimathaanna Sidon arakaanna Galilee tuidiil tiang aleisi, Khuopui soom inti (Decapolis) ramsuung khan aheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Mi lekkhat in akuorkaseet khat-um chong kasuokmak pasal inkhat inheiruoi, halli inmani'n Jisu diang ama chungnga akut duongpi nasik-ah inleiti. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n amakha mipui karra inphut atheinuo-ah aleiruoi, pasalpa kuor suungnga akutchal asulluut ah amachilli amalei kha aleikatookpi, <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />khale inruoiya Jisu'n marwaan tiang enna phuk inthuuk ah kasanna pasal padiang aleiti, <char style="tl">“Ephphatha,” </char> tinachu, <char style="tl">“Inlong taro!” </char><verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Khawa pha takkhan Pasalpa khan akuorkha aharwengjei halli in-ak omlekleiya chong aleiril. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jisu'n mipui diang hiwahi rilsuok maknasik aleitipi, takkha kheella rilmaru tipili mipui'n kheella inleirilsuok. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Khat-um akarangai rakip in tidan omleiya inleingak. “Angtuk kathame ama chuontho rakip hi!” “Ama'n akuorkaseet kha aminharpi khat-um chong kasuokmak kha chong aminsuok!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi Lising mili Awai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matt 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Khawa suoa sootlekleiya mi katamtak inhei intuup. Inmani'n baksik leijetmu, Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaikha akoichunna aleitipi, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Kei'n mipui ngai sik-ah kapoongpi, ajarchu inmani ngaihi nithum keile inom jarra tuunchu baksik neimujei. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kei'n inmani ngaihi minbakleiya inntiang kaminkir inchu inmani kha insina lamma poongna inneisik eii, ajarchu mi lekkhat ramkalaak makheiya kaheiwa in eii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n inleirakel, “Hiwa neelram hinna hiwa mipui minkhopnasik bakphur hi hun muminname?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />“Jisu'n aleirakel, waipool angjet ningneime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">“Waipool sari,” tia inleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ama'n mipui diang nuoipilla in-ongnasik chongpena aleinei. Khale inruoiya waipool sari kha aleiya, Pathian aleini, akatherkhoiya ama siamruoi ngaidiang mipui ngaidiang sempinasik aleitipi, halli ama siamruoi ngai'n leisemna innei. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Inmani'n ngateii lekkhat-um inleinei. Hiwa sik-um Jisu'n Pathian aniya halli ama siamruoi ngaidiang mipuidiang sempiru aleitipi. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9" />Mi rakip in kakhop-ah inleibak, mi lising mili daam inlei eii, khale inruoiya ama siamruoi ngai'n kokwar sari kasip kaliamkha inleikhoomchun. Halli Jisu'n mipui ngaikha aleiminsi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Halli innot tak-ah ama siamruoi ngaile rakuong suungkhan inleiluut-ah Dalmanutha ramtiang inleisi.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee ngai'n Chuon Inlak thonasik inleirakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Pharisee lekkhat in Jisu diang inheiwa-ah amale murruolsiak inleitho. Inmani'n ama kha surthei nasik-ah ensuina inneiya Pathian in izoot eii tina choun inlak naminmuro tia inleirakel. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Matt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Takkha Jisu'n phuk inthuuk ah kasanna aleiti, “Ang jarrame tuunlai khang mingai'n inlak chuon innarakel? Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati! hi ka-ang inlak chuonhi tuunlai mi ngaidiang penuning!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Matt 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Inmani ngaikha ama'n aleimathaanna, rakuong kha achuongnook-ah tuidiil raalkhattiang aleisi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Herod khat-um Pharisee ngai Chol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matt 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Siamruoi ngai'n waipool heichoisik inmanilla rakuong suungnga waipool inkhatbit aleiom.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Inringru, tia Jisu'n chongpena aleinei, “Halli nangni'n Pharisee ngaili Herod chol chungnga insingtheiru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Inmani seng inbiakna inleineiya inleiti, “Eini'n waipool neipimakmi jarra ama'n hiwahi iti eii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jisu'n inmani ngai irilkha aleijet, khale inruoiya ama'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Angsiya waipool ommak jarra inbiakna ningneime? nangni'n lamumak chube khat-um lajetmak chube? nangni eteii ngaidon suokmak chube?<verse eid="MRK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ningmit khan mumakchube? ningkuor khan jetmakchube? nangni'n ngaidon theimakchube, <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezek 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mk 4:12</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />kei'n waipool ra-nga kha mi lising ra-nga sik kikatheer? Kok angjetme nangni'n akaliam ningkhomtuup kha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Inmani'n inleimasang “Soomleini.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Halli kei'n waipool sari kha mi lising mili sik kaleikatheer khoi,” “Kok angjetme nangni'n akaliam ningkhoom chunkha?” tia Jisu'n aleirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">“Sari,” tia inmani'n inleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Halli inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni atuunkatung lajetmakchube?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Bethsaida ah Mitkacho Pasal inkhat aleimindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Inmani'n Bethsaida tiang inheiwa phakhan, mi lekkhat in Jisu diang amitkacho mi inkhat inheiruoiya amadiang nakatookpiro intia chong inleisor. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jisu'n mitkacho mi kha akeiruoiya khuosuung kha aleisuokpui, mipa mitkhan aleimachil suoli, Jisu'n ama takchungnga akut duongnga aleirakel, “Ang ang namume?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Khawa mipa khan chungtiang ahong enna aleiti, “Oh, mipui kha kei'n kamu, takkha inmani ngaikha thingkuung in-angnga insi inhong.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Jisu'n woikhat-um pasalpa mit-ah akut khan aleikatookpi. Khawapha khanchu mipa khan khawalai angnga amujei, halli ama'n angrakip inthiangnga amujei. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jisu'n “Khuosuung khan luutnook khaimaro,” iti chong apeya inntiang aleiminsi.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu jarra irilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matt 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Khale inruoiya Jisu le ama siamruoi ngaikha Caesarea Philipi koolla kaom khuosuung tiang inleisi. Insina lamma asiamruoi ngaidiang aleirakel, “Keidiang heitiru mi ngai'n keihi tu eii innatime?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />“Mi lekkhat in nanghi John Baptist eii innati,” tia inmani'n inleimasang; “Mi lekkhat in innati nanghi Elijah, khale inruoiya mi lekkhat in innati nanghi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat na-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ama'n inmani diang aleirakel “Nangni inleii keihi tu eii ningnatime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peter in aleimasang, “Nang Messiah na-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Khawa suoa Jisu'n inmani ngaidiang chongpena aleinei, “Kei kajarra tudiang um rilpimaru.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Apoongnali Athina sik jarra iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matt 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaikha aleiminchu: “Miring Sapa kha akapoong angjet adeisik eii, khat-um upa ngai, Thiampu Kalian ngai, Sinadan Karu ngai'n zootnunu, halli ama kha inthatsik eii, takkha nithum huuini hongringnook sik eii.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ama'n hiwahi inmani diang inthiangnga aleimalar, hiwa jarra Peter in ama kha asir khat-ah aruoiya ama kha aleiran. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Takkha Jisu'n asir apangnga kaom siamruoi ngaidiang alei enna Peter diang aleiranna aleiti. “Seitan kei kadiang makheiya sitro, Nang i-ngaidon kha Pathian diang makheiya kajuo emak takkha manmasi omchan makheiya eii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Jisu'n ama koolla mipui khat-um asiamruoi ngaikha aleikoi. “Tu ka-ang keile kasizoot mi khan” ama'n inmanidiang aleiti “apumtak inzootmarase, halli ama cross kha kadom inlang kei najuirase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Matt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ajarchu tu ka-ang in aringkhuo insanzoot inchu aringkhuo mangsik eii, takkha keisik beiya khat-um chongkahoi sik beiya aringkhuo apesuok inchu ringna amusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Matt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mi inkhat in manmasituol pumpui ata amin e-innum, aringkhuo aminmang inle amasik anemna angme? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mi inkhat in aringkhuo kha angle inminthuul thei omme? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mi inkhat in kei jarra khat-um kei minchuna hi hiwa Pathian kajetmak khat-um akachok khanghin injak inchu, Miring Sapa innum apa lurna khat-um inthiang marwaan tirton ngaile ajuoni khan ama innum khawa miring chungnga injaksik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleitipi, “Kei'n kadik-ah natipi kate, Pathian Rengram kha ranak le inruoiya akajuokha inmumakleiseng hiwahin mi lekkhat akathimaksik inom.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Meelsuo Inthuul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matt 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Niruk thengli, Jisu'n Peter, James khat-um John aruoiya inmani ngaikha muol insaangtiang inleisi, inmanibit inleiom, inmani'n inlei-en phakhan Jisu meelsuo alei-inthuul. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Halli ama puondiar kachek kha manmasituol puonkasoop mi ngai'n minchek matormak sik katungnga aleichek. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Khale inruoiya asiamruoi inthum ngai'n Moses li Elijah in Jisu le chong inleirilkha inleimu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Peter in akheek-ah Jisu diang aleiti, “Karu, angtuk kathame keini'n hiwa munna kinomhi! Keini'n hiwa munhin maichaam inn inthum kinsaksik eii, nang nasik inkhat, Moses sik inkhat, halli Elijah sik inkhat.” <figure style="fig" alt="Tent" file="co01443b.TIF" size="col" ref="9:5">Maichaam inteii</figure> <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ama'n rilsik leijetmak jarra, Peter khat-um aleiilaak ngai'n inleingak.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Khale inruoiya suumphai aheiwa-ah inmani ngaikha aleimakhu, halli suumphai makheiya rasa ajuonei, “Hiwahi kei iminriangkhet kasapa eii ama iti rangairu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Inmani'n innot theiya insir inpangkha inlei-en phakhan inmani'n Jisu eleiya tuteii leimumu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Amuol makheiya injuochum phakhan, Jisu'n inmani diang chong aleipeii, “Ning imu ngaihi nangni'n tu miring diang-um rilpimaru, Miring Sapa kha kathi makheiya ahongringnook maklaiseng.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Inmani'n ama chongpe kha inleijui, inmani'n hiwa jarra khatli inkhat diang inlei-inkel, “Akathi makheiya ringnooksik tihi ang tiname?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Halli inmani'n Jisu diang inleirakel, “Angjarra Dan kamajia Karu ngai'n Elijah eii kajuo masasik intime?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:4">Matt 11:4</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Halli “Ama'n inmani diang aleimasang, Elijah kha eii angrakip kaminsuuk sik-ah akajuo masasik, halle angjarra Pathian chong inthiang khan Miring Sapa kha poongna angjet adeisik eii khat-um mi ngai'n zootnunu itime? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kei'n nangni diang kanati, Elijah chu aleijuo suojei, khale inruoiya chong inthiang in ama jarra ileiti angnga, mi ngai'n ama chungnga inthozootkha inthosuojei.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ratha Kathamak kaluut Pasal Nai inkhat imindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Matt 17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Inmani'n asiamruoi leiilaak ngaidiang injuopha khan, inmani'n mipui katamtak inkoolla khat-um Dan Karu ngai'n inmanile murruolsiak inleitho kha injuomu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mipui'n Jisu kha inleimu phakhan inmani'n inleingak, halli inmani'n inheitaanna Jisu kha chubei inleitho. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleirakel, “Angjarra nangni'n inmanile murruolsiak ningthome?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mipui ngai karra miring inkhat in ahongmasang, “Karu, kasapa suungnga ratha kathamak om halli chong asuokmak jarra kei'n nangdiang kaheiruoi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ratha kathamak in ama kha asur racham, ama'n nepilla inluoiya abaiya achilphuon aleisuok, aha aleikarial, khat-um apum kha leikeichangkhang, khawa khan ajar eya kei'n nasiamruoi ngaidiang napuutsuok pinasik kaleiti, takkha inmani'n leimatormu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Eh ngamna kaneimak nangni ngai! Nangnile angtuk kasoot kei'n kalaom suomsikme? Kei'n nangni kha angtuk kasoot kanaladeipui sikme? naipangpa kha keidiang heiruoiru!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Inmani'n ama kha Jisu diang inheiruoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Kathamak ratha'n Jisu kha aleimu phakhan, jetlei theileiya ratha kathamak in naipangpa kha keichang khangnga juodeengjuon, halli amurra achilphuon sip-ah neipilla inlet inkhup-ah lei-inluoi.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />“Angtuk kasoot mejei hin tinahi?” Jisu'n apadiang aleirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Naipang elaiya inphut eii tia,” ama'n aleimasang. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />“Apha angjet akathamak ratha'n amahi thatnasik-ah mei khat-um tuiya ideengluut ejei. Nang in namator inchu, keihi naminriangro khat-um nasanro!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jisu'n ama diang aleiti, “Ingamna kanei ama diangchu! ang rakip ethei eii.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Khawapha takkhan apa'n ahongkheek-ah aheiti, “Kei ngamna kanei, kei ngamna kasuolhi nasanro!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jisu'n mipuikha inmani omnatiang inheinai amupha khan, ratha kathamak diang chong aleipeii, “Kuorseet khat-um chong kasoukmak ratha,” Jisu'n aleiti, “Naipangpa makheiya nang in heisuok inlang halli inlet-ah luutnook khaimaro.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ratha khan akheek-ah, naipangpa kha keichang khangnga natheiya juodeengjuonna halli aheisuokjei, naipangpa kha akathi alei-ang, halli mi rakip in inleiti, “ama hi athijei!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Takkha Jisu'n naipangpa kha akutkhan amahuumma aleikeithei, halli ama'n ahongngir.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Jisu'n innsuung aleiluut phakhan, ama siamruoi ngai'n ruuk-ah inleirakel, “Angjarra keini'n ratha kathamak kha kinpuutsuok matormakme?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Pathian kani elekleiya hiwa ngaihi puutsuok matornutun.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Athinasik li Aringnasik arilpinook</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Matt 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Jisu khat-um ama siamruoi ngai'n khawa munkha inleimathaan, Galilee suungtiang inleisi phakhan, Jisu'n tudiang-um ama sina leiminjet zootmak, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ajarchu ama siamruoi ngaikha aleiminchu: “Miring Sapa kha mi ngai kutchungnga pe-inta inthatsik eii halli nithum huuini khan ahongringnook sik.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Takkha inmani'n hiwa minchu nahi leijet matormu, khale inruoiya inmani'n amadiang karakel sik inleichi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tume Kalokkhet?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matt 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Inmani'n Capernaum tiang inheiwa-ah, innsuung inluut phakhan Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleirakel, “Angjarrame nangni'n lamma murruolsiak ningthokha?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Takkha inmani'n leimasangmu, ajarchu inmani'n lamma murruolsiak inleitho khachu tume akalokkhet tijarra eii.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Jisu'n alei in-ongnga asiamruoi soomleini ngaikha aleikoi, halli inmani diang aleitipi, “Atu ka-ang in chung kanungkhet ezoot inchu ama kha nuoi kanungkhet esik eii, halli mirakip nuoiya kasiinkhet suok a-esik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Matt 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mk 10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ama'n naipang inkhat aheiruoiya inmani ngai maikuungnga aleiminngir, ama'n akakuoa inmani ngaidiang aleitipi, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Tu ka-ang mi inkhat in hiwa naipang ngai inkhattak kei karamingnga karalaang kha kei innaralaang eii halli kei kanaralaang mikha keibit kanaralaang emak takkha kei kanajuotirpa kha-um inralaang kha eii.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atu ka-ang eini Inhalpuimak Mikha eini Mi eii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luk 9:49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />John in amadiang aleitipi, “Karu, keini'n mi inkhat nang naramingnga raikhuo ipuutsuok kinmu, halli keini'n ama kha kinleikhaap, ajarchu ama kha eini karra mi lei-emak.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleitipi, “Ama kha khaapmaru,” “Ajarchu atu ka-ang in chuon inlak kei ramingnga kathomator mikhan innottheiya keihi kathamak-ah narilsenuni.<verse eid="MRK 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Atu ka-ang in einile inhalmak mikha eini mi in-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Matt 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11:23</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ajarchu nangkha Christa mi na-eii tia, atu ka-ang in tuirabing inkhat kei karamingnga insik-ah anape inchu, kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kanati, ama chountho mankha mangnuni.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Matt 10:42</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manu minthonasik Matheemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matt 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luk 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Atu ka-ang in naipang ngai inkhat kei kadiang ingamna kaminmang ama khachu, ariingnga lungchakari inkhitli tuipui inthuup ah indeengluut kha athadoom.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Khale inruoiya nang nakut in manu anamintho inchu nakut kha tanro! Kut inni huuiya hektik kaboi meikhurra kaluutsik neek-ah, kut khatbeiya hektik kaboi ringkhuo Pathian Rengram kaluutkha athadom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Matt 5:30</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Inmani ka-ei ralung ngaikha supthi thinunu khat-um inmani kakaang mei kha supthi thinuni. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Khale inruoiya nang nakeii-in ingamna aminmang inchu, tanro! keii inni huuiya meikhur kaluutsik nekchu keii inchelleiya ringna kaluutkha athadoom, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Khawa khan inmani ka-ei ralung ngaikha supthi thinunu khat-um inmani kakaang mei kha supthi thinuni.<verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Halli nang namit-in ingamna kha aminmang inchu, kelsuokro! mit inni eya meikhur kaluutsik neek achu mit inkhat bit-ah Pathian Rengram kaluutkha athadoom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Matt 5:29</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Khawa khan inmani ka-ei ralung ngaikha supthi thinunu, khat-um inmani kakaang mei kha supthi thinuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isa 66:24</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Dooiphur kha machiya inminthiang angnga mi rakip-um meiya aminthiangsik eii.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Machi hi a-al; takkha i-alkha amang inchu, angtho tholia woikhat min-al mator minname?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">Nangni ningpum suungnga machi kha minomru, halli kahoi kadaiya omsuomru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matt 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ompui Sangram Inthenna Jarra Jisu'n Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matt 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Halli Jisu'n khawa munkha amathaanna Judea ramsuung tiang aleisi, halli Jordan tuidung kha aleirakaanna ama'n mi katamtak kaheiwa ngaidiang matiangnga ileiminchu angnga aleirilpi.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Pharisee lekkhat in ama koolla inheiwa-ah ama surna sik-ah ensuina inleinei. Inmani'n inleirakel, “Natipiro,” “Pasal inkhat in anumei inthenpui nasik ah Dan in zootbe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Moses in nangnidiang, angkachang Dan napame?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Inmani'n inleiti, “Moses in inthenna cheiikha pasalpa in amajia li anumei kha inthenpui sik-ah azoot.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Innidan 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Matt 5:31</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni ningmalung ningminngar jarra Moses in hiwa Dan hi ileimajia eii.<verse eid="MRK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Takkha Pathian kutbool inphutna khan pasal khat-um numeisa aleibool. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Inphut 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Khawa jarra pasal in anu apa mathaanta anumeile inchunsik eii.<verse eid="MRK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Halli inmani inni'n taksa inkhatbit in e-sik eii, khawa jarra inmani inni'n inni etheinunu, takkha taksa inkhat in-esik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Inphut 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Pathian in iminchun kha manmasi miring inkhat innum minthenthei nunu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n inntiang inkir phakhan Jisu diang hiwa jarra inleirakel,<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiril, “Tu ka-ang pasal in anumei inthenpui suoli numeisa inkhat anei inchu ama kha anumei takchungnga zool-inthai eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Matt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Hile in-angnga, atu ka-ang numeisa innum aruothar inthenpuili pasal inkhat anei inchu aruothar chungnga zool-inthai eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Naipang ngaidiang Rawaan ­­­­­­­­­­Pena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Mi lekkhat in naipang ngai chungnga akut duongpi nasik-ah Jisu diang inheiruoi, takkha ama siamruoi ngai'n naipang kaheiruoi ngaikha inleiran. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jisu'n hiwa amu phakhan aleiraangnga inmani diang aleiti, “Naipang ngaikha kei kadiang heiwarasu inmani kha khaapmaru, ajarchu Pathian Rengram kha hiwa ka-ang naipang ngaita eii. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kanati, Pathian Rengram kha naipang inkhat in iralaang angnga ningralaangmak inchu, ama Rengram luutthei nutun.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Halli naipang ngaikha akakuo chunna, ama'n inmani chungnga akut duongnga rawaan aleipeii.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inchong Pasal Inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Halli Jisu'n lamma kasi aheiphutnook phakhan pasal inkhat in aheitaanna ama diang inkunna aleiti. “Katha Karu, hektik kaboi ringkhuo munasik-ah angme kathosik?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />“Angjarra katha tia ninakoime?” Jisu'n ama diang aleiti, “Tuteii katha ommu, Pathian khabit eii katha. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Chongpeii kha nang in najet: ‘Mi kathat emaro; zool-inthai emaro, inruup thomaro, mi ngaikha rilsemaro, maleisei rilmaro, nanu napa kayaro.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mipa in aleiti, “Karu” “Hiwa Sinadan rakip ngaihi naipang ka-elaiya inphut kahongjui wiakjei.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jisu'n amadiang minriang tak-ah ahei-enna aleiti, “Nang in nathosik Dan inkhat alaom. Si-inlang ninei rakip juor inlang sara ngaidiang sial ngaikha juopero, kha e-inchu marwaan ramma na-inchongsik eii, heikirnook inlang kanuk najuiro,” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ama'n hiwa chong ajetpha khan, ama maisuokhan kahoimak in sip-ah akirjei, ajarchu ama kha inchongthei mi alei eii.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jisu'n amit-en minloonna asiamruoi ngaidiang ahei-enna aleiti, “Angtuk intakme inchong miring in Pathian Rengram kaluutsik!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Hiwa chong in asiamruoi ngaikha ngakna inleinei, takkha Jisu'n inlet-ah aleiril, “Kei kasangai, Pathian Rengram kaluut sik-hi angtuk intakme! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Inchong khat in Pathian Rengram kaluutsik neek achu salaileem inkhat in simphuoi kuorra kaluutsik kha abeidet.” <figure style="fig" alt="Camel" file="hk00038c.tif" size="col" ref="10:25">Salaaileem</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Hiwa chong hin asiamruoi ngai'n inthiangnga inleingak-ah inmani khatli inkhatdiang inlei-inkel, “Kha e-inchu tume ringna kamusik?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jisu'n inmani diang encheiya aleimasang, “Miring ngaisik achu hiwahi etheinuni, takkha Pathian diangchu ethei, ang rakip Pathian diangchu ethei eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Halli Peter in ahongril, “Enro, angrakip kinmathaanna keini'n nang kinnajuijei.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Inthiangnga kei'n nangni diang kanati, atu ka-ang in, in-u innai emakli innu inpa, insangai emakli in-inn inlei kei chongkahoi sik-ah inmathaan inchu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />atuunna ringkhuo hin saruk rajakhat khella inn, ulenai, nu, sa, lei, khat-um poongna ngaihi inmusik eii, halli akahongsik ringkhuo khanchu kumsoot ringna inmusik eii. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Takkha atuunna mi katamtak ma-insa ngai'n nuk inlatongsik eii, halli tuunna mi katamtak nuk intong ngai'n ma inlasasik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Athinasik Jarra Woithum Changna Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaile Jerusalem lamma insi phakhan, Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai neek-ah ma asa-ah aleisi, anuk kajui ngaikha akachi in aleisip. Jisu'n woikhat inlet-ah asiamruoi ngaikha inteina mun inkhat-ah aminchunna ama diangnga kasuoksik chuon ngaikha arilpinook. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Rangairu, “Ama'n aleiti, Miring Sapa kha Thiampu Kalian khat-um Dan Karu ngaidiang inpenasik mun Jerusalem tiang kasisik ni-eii. Inmani ngai'n Jisu kha kathi sik-ah rahoi suok tina noonkuung pe-inta Zaatlop ngaidiang inpesik eii, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />inmani ngai'n ama kha innuipui inta, machilthuon inta, kase-ah wuok inta halli inthatsik eii, takkha nithum huuini ahongring nooksik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">James li John Chubei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matt 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Zebedee sa-ngai James li John in Jisu diang inheiwa-ah inleiti, “Karu,” “Keini'n angme inkhat nang nadiang keini sik-ah kinnaminthozoot inkhat om.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jisu'n aheirakel, “Angme ningna minthozoot?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Inmani'n inheimasang, “Nang in-ongna Rengram poina khan, keini inni khat-in changtiang khat-in weitiang in-ongsik nazootpiro.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, nangni'n ningna rakelna ajarkha jetmakchujei, kei ka-insik poongna rabing kha nangni inmator tunbo? Kei Baptize kathosik angnga nangnileii Baptize thomator tunbo? <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk 12:50</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Inmani'n inleiti, “Kinthomator.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei i-in rabingkha nangni'n inmator ningte, halli kei'n Baptize kitho angnga nangni innum thoningte. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Takkha tume kei kakut changtiang khat-um kaweitiang in-ongsik khachu kei'n kadang matormong. Khachu Pathian in amun iboolpi khat-um ama ikadang mi ngaisik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Hiwahi anuk kajui aleiilaak soom ngai'n inleijet phakhan, inmani'n James li John diang inleiraang,<verse eid="MRK 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />halli Jisu'n asiamruoi rakip ngaikha akoolla akoichunna aleitipi, “Zaatlop tia nilei Reng ngai'n inmani roonna rammachu mi rakip chungnga wai inroon, halli inmani lamkakei ngai'n thomatorna rakip innei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ang e-innum hiwahi, nangni karrachu etheinuni, hanna nangni karra miring inkhat in akalok ezoot inchu, ama kha mirakip suok esik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Matt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Halli nangni karra miring inkhat in alukhet ezoot inchu, ama'n mi rakip suok erase, <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />ajarchu Miring Sapa hi sepa inthosik-ah kajuo emak, sepa katho sik khat-um mipui kasanring sik-ah aringkhuo kapesik ijuo eii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mitkacho Bartimaeus Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Inmani'n Jericho ah inheiwa, halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai khat-um mi katamtak le inheiwa phakhan, bukani mitkacho araming Bartimaeus, Timaeus sapa kha lampui sirra in-ongnga aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ama'n Nazareth Jisu eii ti aleijet phakhan, “Jisu! David sapa! kei naminriangro!” tia ama'n inringnga aleikheek.<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mi katamtak in, Omchianro intia ama kha inleiran. Takkha ama'n “David Sapa, kei naminriangro!” tia kheel kheella aleikheek.<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jisu'n alei-ngirra aleiti, “Ama kha heikoiru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Khale inruoiya inmani'n mitkacho pakha inheikoi. Inmani'n inleitipi, “Rok inlang!” “Intheitro, Jisu'n nangkha anaheikoi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Khawa suoli apuon adiar ngaikha adeengjuonna, chungtiang inchoomma, halli Jisu diang aheiwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jisu'n aleirakel. “Angme nangsik ah kei ninaminthozoot?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Karu,” kei kamit kamuzootnook tia amit kachopa khan aheimasang.<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jisu'n ama diang aleiti, “Sitro,” “Nang ingamna khan anamindamjei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Khawapha takkhan amit amuwa khawa lamkhan Jisu nuk aleijui.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Raal matorra Jerusalem iluut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-21">Matt 21:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Inmani ngai'n Jerusalem inheinai phakhan, Bethphage khat-um Bethany khuopui koolla, Olive Chingbung khan inmanikha inheiwa. Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai karra miring inni inmatiang aleitir, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Hin itipile inruoiya: “Ningma ah kaom khuokhan siru. Ningluutli ningluutmak, nangni'n inlachuongmak Salungdai teii inthungnga kaom muningte. Suut-inlang hin heiruoiru. <figure style="fig" alt="Colt/Donkey" file="hk00033c.tif" size="col" ref="11:2">Salungdai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Tu ka-ang in angsikme inti inchu, hintiru, Karu'n <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Karu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">keelngam mapupa.</char></note> ka-inliingnasik ajar om, halli innottheiya naheithaknook kinte tipiru.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Inmani'n insiya lamsirra kaom inn inkhat ma-ah inthungnga kaom Salungdai kha injuomu. Inmani'n insuutlai takkhan, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />mi lekkhat kangirra kaom ngai'n inleirakel, “Angkeme ningtho, angsiyame Salungdai kha ningsuut?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Inmani'n Jisu itijek kha inleimasang, khale inruoiya mipui ngai'n inmani kha inleiminsi. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Inmani'n Salungdai teii kha Jisu diang inheichoi, inpuon ngaikha Salungdai chungnga indaap, halli Jisu'n Salungdai kha aleichuong. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Mi katam tak-in inpuondiar kha lamma inleitha, mi lekkhat in khawa weella kaom thingbuo intuk ah lamkhan inleitha.<verse eid="MRK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ama ah kasi mi ngai khat-um anuk-ah kahongjui ngai'n inringnga inleikheek, “Hosanna! Pumi ramingnga kajuo ama kha rawaan katha eii! <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Minpkla 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Akahongsik nipa David Rengram kha rawaan katha eii, Hosanna insaang khet-ah!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jisu'n Jerusalem aheitungnga, Biak-inn suungtiang aleiluut, halli angrakip kha takkachangnga alei-en. Takkha kholei jo-e jarra asiamruoi soomleini ngaikhale Bethany tiang inleikir.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Theichang kuungdiang Khomaak saamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Matt 21:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Khawa ziingkhuo warra, inmani'n Bethany makheiya inheikirnook phakhan, Jisu kha awon aleichaampi. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ama'n raalkhat makheiya abuokatha theichang kuungkhat aleimu, leikarate tia aka-en aleisi. Takkha atungpha khanchu, ama'n abuobei ajuomu, ajarchu theichang karapha kha lei-emak. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jisu'n theichang kuungdiang aleiti, “Tuteii inkhat innum nang nakuung makheiya nakara kabak ekhaimarasu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Halli asiamruoi ngai'n ama itihi inleijet.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Biak-inn luutna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matt 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Inmani'n Jerusalem inheitung phakhan, Jisu kha Biak-inn tiang aleisi halli phurkajuor khat-um karacho mirakip kha puutna aleiphut. Sialchuoi kamakoi ngai khamtuol khat-um Wathu kajuor ngai lukham rakipkha aleimalet aleimakhup, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />halli ama'n tuteii-um phurpai heikachoiya kaheiwa ngaikha Biak-inn tuollaidung-um leiminluutmak.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ama'n mipui ngaikha aleiminchu: “Pathian chong inthiang khan hintia lei-injia emak-abe? ‘Kei inn chu phungli zaat rakip ngai Pathian ninasik inn eii.’ Takkha nangni'n inruup kathongai inthupna ningmin ejei!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Thiampu Kalian khat-um Dan kaminchu Karu ngai'n khawakha inleijet, khawa khan ajar eya Jisu thatnasik-ah lam inlei-entok. Inmani ngai'n ama kha inleichi, ajarchu mipui rakip ngai'n ama chongrilkhan inleingak.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kholei hei-epha khanchu, Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngai'n khuopui kha inleimathaan.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang kuungdiang makheiya Inchusik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matt 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ziingtiang ma-ah, inmani'n lamma inheiwa phakhan, theichang kuungkha aler makheiya akuung katung akaleichar kha inleimu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Peter in aleikasuok kha i-ngaidon khale inruoiya Jisu diang aleiti, “Enro, Karu, theichangkuung khomaak nisaamkha athijei!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Pathian kha ngamnaru.<verse eid="MRK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kanati, khachu tu ka-ang in amalungnga ingamsam omlekleiya hiwa chinghi inphuk inlang tuipuiya indeengluutro, halli ama'n itikha asuoksik eii tia ngamna inchu, ama diang asuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Matt 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Cor 13:2</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Khawa jarra kei'n nangni diang kati: Nangni'n Pathian diang angmekhat ningni kaalla, kinmujei tia ngamnaru, halli ningni rakip kha nangnidiang anapesik eii. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nangni'n kanisik ningngir phakhan, miring khatdiang kahoimak kaomngai rakip kha ngaidamru, khale inruoiya marwaanna kaom ningpa Pathian innum ningmanu ngaikha narangaidamte. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Nangni'n mi ngai ningngaidammak inchu, marwaanna kaom ningpa Pathian innum ningmanu ngaikha ngaidamnuni.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Ranak neina jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matt 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Inmani'n Jerusalem khan woikhat inlet-ah inheiwa. Jisu'n Biak-inn suungnga khan asiya omlaikhan, Thiampu Kalian, Dan Karu ngai, khat-um upa ngai'n amadiang inheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Halli amadiang injuorakel, “Ang ranak naneiya hiwa ngai rakip nithome? Nangdiang hika-ang thomatorna ranak tu napeme?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangni diang chong khatbit narakel kate, halli nangni'n keidiang ningna masang inchu, kei-um angranak-ah hi ngai rakip hi kithome tihi natipi kate. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Keidiang naheimasangru, John in baptize minthona ranakkha humakheiya kajuome? Pathian diang makheiya kajuobe emakli miring makheiyabe?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Inmaniseng inbiakna inleinei: “Angme eini'n nitisik? ‘Pathian diang,’ makheiya niti innum, ama'n hin atisik, ‘Angjarra, halle, nangni'n John ningngamna makme?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Takkha miring makheiya niti innum” (Inmani'n mipuikha inleichi, ajarchu mirakip in John hi Pathian chongkachoipa eii tia inleilei.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Inmani ngai'n Jisu diang inleimasang, “Keini jetkhai mungjei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Angranak kaneiya hi ngai rakip kithome, kei-um nangni diang tinuning.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Theibom Billa Chuon kathongai khale Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matt 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Halli Jisu'n chongminkhina aneiya inmani ngaidiang aleiril: “Apha khat-ah theibombil katho miring inkhat aleiom, theibombil kha aleirakul, theibomju soomnasik ah khur kha-um aleikhuor, khat-um theibom ngaaknasik-ah berteii aleisak. Khawa khale inruoiya ama'n theibombil kha achuon katho mi ngaidiang aleiminhuum, halli inn mathaanna ram khattiang aleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Theibom rakhoolpha aheitung khanchu, ama'n suok inkhat changsik kasuok ramparman kalei achuon katho mi ngaidiang aleiminsi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Achuon katho mi ngai'n suokpakha inleisurra inleiwuok, khat-um iteii minchoi lekleiya injuominkir. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Amapupa khan suok leiilaak inkhat atirnook; achuon katho mi ngai'n ama kha alu inleiwuok hop-ah khat-um enseel musit-ah injuominkir. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Amapupa kha'n suok leiilaak inkhat aleiminsinook, inmani ngai'n ama kha inleithat; khat-um inmani'n kasi ngai rakip diang khawa khale in-angrip inleitho, mi lekkhat inleiwuok khat-um mi lekkhatchu inleithat. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mi inkhatbit tirsik-ah kalaom khachu iminriangkhet asapa kha eii. Ahekna ah, ama'n asapa kha achuon katho mi ngaidiang aleiminsi. ‘Kei'n ngamna kanei, suoilekleiya inmani ngai'n kasapa chu khoya leitho inte,’ ama'n aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Takkha achuon katho ngai'n khatli inkhat inlei inbiak, amahi inluokaluok sikpa eii, hongtru, eini'n amahi thattui, halli ama changsik kasuokkha einisik esikjei. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n asapa kha insurra inleithat halli akaluong kha theibombil raaltiang inleideengjuon.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Angme, halle, theibombil mapupa'n athosik?” “Ama'n juota chuon katho ngaikha athatsik eii, halli theibombil kha mi leiilaak diang aminhuumsik eii.<verse eid="MRK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nangni'n hiwa Pathian chong inthianghi lateel makchube?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Inn kasak ngai'n nemna ommakjei tia indeengjuon lungkha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">akilla kaom nemna kaomkhet lungkha ahong eii<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Hiwahi Pumi itho kha eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">mit enna angtuk ngak kaom me!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Minpkla 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Jihudi lamkakei ngaikhan Jisu surnasik inleitho, ajarchu inmani'n hiwa chongminkhi hi inmani diang ama'n iminkhi eii tia inleijet. Takkha inmani'n mipui ngaikha inleichi, khale inruoiya inmani'n amakha inmathaanna inleisi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rampar Pesik jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matt 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Pharisee lekkhat li Herod mi lekkhat Jisu chong rilsial surnasik-ah chong karakel inleitir. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Inmani'n ama diang inheiwa-ah inleiti, “Karu, keini'n kinjet nang kadikbei naril, tuteii diang-um nichi ommak. Nang tuteii meel enleiya, takkha Pathian lam kadikkha naminchu. Keini diang rilro, eini Sinadan dungjuiya Rome Rengpa diang ramparhi nipesikbe penuminbe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani palaak kha imule inruoiya aleimasang, “Angsik ame nangni'n kei nasurnasik ningtho? Dangkapum kha heichoiru, halli kei'n enkate.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Inmani'n dangkapum inkhat inheichoi, halli ama'n aleirakel, “Tu ramil khat-um tu ramingme hiwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">“Caesar,” tia inmani'n inleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Thajei, hanchu, Caesar takha Caesar diang peru, halli Pathian takha Pathian diang peru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Halli inmani'n Jisu chongkhan inleingak.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathi ngai Ringnookna jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matt 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Khawa phakhan hongkaring ommak kati Sadducee ngai'n Jisu diang inheiwa-ah injuorakel, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Chuon 23:8</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Karu, Moses in hiwa Danhi einisik-ah aleimajia: ‘pasal inkhat athiya khat-um anumei kha sa neileiya ada inchu, khawa pasal u-nai inkhat in chuulmei kha aneisik eii ajarchu sa neinasik, halli in-inei sa kha akathipa sa esik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Innidan 25:5</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Apha khat-ah u-nai sari inleiom; upa khetpa kha, inn aleinei halli sa neilekleiya aleithi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Halli inni huuinapa khan anumei kha aleinei, ama kha-um sa neilekleiya aleithi. Khawa khale in-angrip-ah inthum huuinapa diang-um aleisuok, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />U-nai sari katung in numeisanu kha inleinei halli inraya-ah sa neilekleiya inleithi. Hekna ah numeisanu kha-um athijei. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Tuunchu, kathi ngai inraya ah inhongring nookni nikhuokhan, ama kha tu numei esikme? ajarchu inmani sari ngai'n numeisanu kha inleineiwiak.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “angtuk nangni ningdik makme, angjarrame ningjetbo? ajarchu nangni'n Pathian chong inthiang emakli Pathian ranakkha jetmakchuwa eii. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kathi ngai inringnookni khanchu, inmani ngai khachu marwaanna tirton ngaikhale in-angsik eii, khat-um innkanei ti omnuni.<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Tuunchu, akathi ngai hongring nookna, Moses imajia suulbuklai kaangna larik munkha teelmakchube? Khawakhan hintia injia, tichu Pathian'n Moses diang aleiti, ‘Kei Abraham Pathian ka eii, Isaac Pathian ka eii, khat-um Jacob Pathian ka eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Suok 3:6</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Amahi akaringngai Pathian eii, akathi ngai Pathian emak. Nangni inthiangnga dikmak chujei!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akalokkhet Chongpeii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matt 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Dan Karu inkhat ahongnga inmani inbiakkha aleirangai. Jisu'n Sadducee ngaidiang chongmasang katha ileimasang kha aleimu, khantia ama'n Jisu koolla aheiwa-ah aleirakel: “Huwa chongpeii hume araya karra kathakhet?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Akathakhet khachu hi eii: ‘Rangairu, Israel! Pumi eini Pathian hi inkhatbit eii. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumi eini Pathian hi inkhatbit eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pumi hi eini Pathian eii, ma khabit eii Pumi.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Pumi na Pathian kha namalung pumpuiya, naratha pumpuiya, na-ngaidonna rakip-ah, khat-um naranak pumpuiya minriangro.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Innidan 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Inni huuina akathakhet chongpe kha hi eii: ‘Na-indiang na-inwaipui mi ngaikha napumtak niminriang angnga minriangro.’ Hiwa inni neek-ah aleiilaak akatha chongpeii ommak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Dan Karu'n Jisu diang aleiti, “Athajei, Karu! nang in kadik-ah nariljei, khachu Pumi khabit eii Pathian, ama elekleiya Pathian tuteii inkhat-um ommu.<verse eid="MRK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Halli nang na Pathian kha namalung, na-ngaidonna khat-um naranak pumpuiya minriangro; halli nang napumtak niminriang angnga na-indiang na-inwaipui mi ngaikha minriangro. Hiwa chongpeii inni kajuihi pena munna Pathian diang ran khat-um phurpai kapeneek-ah athawiai.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Dan Karu'n singtheiya iheimasang kha Jisu'n amupha khan, Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Nang Pathian Rengram khale inlaak makchejei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Khawa thengnga tuteii inkhat-um Jisu diang chong inkelngam ommujei.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Messiah jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matt 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jisu'n Biak-inna aminchuwa leiomlai khan, Ama'n aleirakel, “Ang tilia Dan Karu ngai'n Messiah hi David sapa eii intime?<verse eid="MRK 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ratha Inthiang in David mursuo tak-ah aminti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Pumi khan kei Pumi diang aleiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Kei'n nang inhalpui ngaikha nakeii nuoiya kadamak laiseng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Kei kachangtiang hin in-ongro.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />David apumtak innum ‘Pumi’ tia akoi; kha enchu angjarra Messiah hi David sapa esikme?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Jisu'n Dan Karu ngai chungnga Chongthak</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Mipui ngai'n Jisu chongkha karok-ah inleirangai. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ama'n iminchule inruoiya aleiti, “Ensuiru Dan kaminchu ocha ngaikha, inret inruo inchuol kha inluk-ah kasi kahong kamanuom khat-um mi intuupna phaiya khoya inleitho kamanuom, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Synagogue-ah in-ongna kahoikhet kakadang, khat-um baknamun kahoikhet kakadang, <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Inmani nemnasik-ah chuulmei ngai neinaak kakasut, halli mi ngai musik-ah Pathian diang kasoot-ah kani, inmani ngai rachaakna kha anakhetsik eii!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chuulmeinu Sialpeii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jisu'n Biak-inn suungnga sial mintiingna koolla in-ongnga omlai khan, ama'n mi ngai sial machul kha alei-en. Mi inchong ngai'n sial katamtak inleimachul; <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Halli sara ka-ethei chuulmei inkhat hongnga anna inkhatle in-ang sumsenpum inni aleimachul, <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Jisu'n asiamruoi rakip akoichunna aleitipi, “Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kanati khachu hi chuulmei sara-nu khan sial mintiingna kokkhan mirakip neek-ah tamwiai amachul. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Mi leiilaak rakipchu in-inei makheiya inthenli inleipeii; takkha numeisanu khachu, sara ethei innum, inei rakip kha aleipeii, aringnasik rakip kha ama'n aleipewiak.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Biak-inn Kakoisik jarra Jisu'n iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Matt 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luk 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jisu'n Biak-inn aleimathaan phakhan, asiamruoi inkhat in amadiang aleiti, “Enro, Karu! lungngai khat-um inhongsak inn-ngaihi angtuk-ah enzoot kaomme!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Hituk-ah kalok inhongsak inn ngaihi nang namubo? Hinna kaom lungngaihi inkhat in inkhat chungnga inkamma kaom omnuni; lungngai rakip hi alachiam wiaksik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kapoong Karaal jarra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matt 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Jisu'n Biak-inn raalkhat tiang kaom Olive chingbungnga alei in-ongnga omlaikhan, Peter, James, John, khat-um Andrew in ruuk-ah inhongnga amadiang inhongrakel. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Keini diang narilpiro hiwa ngaihi angtik ah akasuok sikme? Khat-um keini diang natipiro hiwa ngai rakip suoknasi phahi heiwajei ti jetnasik-ah ang alasuok sikme?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Tuteii innum nangni kha lamleiitiang naruoimak nasik insingtheiru. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mi katamtak in, kei ramingnga, heiwa inta intisik eii, ‘Kei ama kha ka eii!’ halli inmani'n mi katamtak lamleiitiang inlakeiruoi sik eii. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nangni'n raalchong khat-um raalthang ningjet phakhan, chimaru. Khawa ngaikha alasuoksik eii, takkha khawa ngai'n aheknapha ejei tichu la-emak. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Zaat khatli zaatkhat, rengram khatli rengram khat raal inla-inthosik eii; Ram angjet-ah rinok khat-um bukawaang aomsik eii. Hiwa ngai rakip hi nai neimadet naiha kahongmasa kanakha ka-ang eii.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Nangni inringtheiru. Nangni nahongsur inta khat-um katar ngaidiang innalaruoi sik eii. Synagogue-ah nangni innalawuok sik eii; Nangni'n Waikaroon ngai khat-um Rengngai maikuungnga kei jarra sakhi kapesik-ah ninglangir sik eii.<verse eid="MRK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Takkha aheknapha heitung ma-ah, hiwa chong kahoihi zaat rakip diang inlarilsik eii.<verse eid="MRK 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Halli nangni innasurra khat-um katar ngai chongtanna inna innaruoi phakhan, angme ningrilsik tia ningmalung minpoong maru; apha heitung phakhan, nangni diangnga napeii chongkha rilru, chongngai kha nangnichong enuni takkha Ratha Inthiang diang makheiya akajuo kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 1:17-20">Matt 1:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />A-u anai inkhat in a-u anai inkhat chungnga thinasik-ah alapesuok sik eii, khat-um pa ngai'n insa ngaikha thinasik-ah inpesuok sik eii. Insa ngai innum innu inpa chungnga hong-om inta inlaminthat sik eii.<verse eid="MRK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Mi rakip in kei jarra nangni innamatir sik eii. Takkha tu ka-ang in ahekna katung adeimator inchu ringna amusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Matt 10:22</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inrimna Kalok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matt 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“ ‘Matir Karuoi Chikaom Inkhat’ A-ngirmun ka-emak munna ngirra kaomkha nangni'n muningte.” (Akateel ngaikha'n ang tiname jetrasu!) “Khawa phakhan tu ka-ang Judea-ah kaom ngai'n chingtiang taanrasu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Inn chungnga kaom mi khan insuungnga kaom aneinaak kaleisik beiya juchumkhai marase.<verse eid="MRK 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Tu ka-ang leiya kaom in puondiar kalum kalei sik-ah inntiang kirkhai marase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Khawa phakhan tu ka-ang naikawon khat-um nainu ngaisik-ah angtuk-ah poong kaomsik me! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Pathian diang niru tichu hiwa ngaihi phalbiya asuokmak nasik.<verse eid="MRK 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ajarchu Pathian in manmasituol aboolla inphut atuun katungnga lakasuok ngaimak han angtik niteii-um kasuok maksik akalokkhet poongna nikhuo kha esik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Chonglar 7:14</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Takkha Pumi'n khawa nikhuo ngaikha aminbongmak inchu, tuteii-um ringthei nunu. Ma ikadang mi ngai sikbitchu, nikhuo ngaikha aminbongpi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Khawa phakhan, tu ka-ang-in nangni diang, ‘Enro, Messiah hin om!’ emakli, ‘Enro, Ama kha son om!’ inti innum ngamna maru. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Tichu Christa omchanna inleem khat-um kadikmak Pathian chongkachoi inhong inlarsik eii. Ethei inchu, Pathian ikadangjei mi ngai-um lamleiitiang minsina sik-ah inmani'n chuon inlak khat-um ngakkaom inthosik eii. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Khawa jarra Inringtheiru! Kei'n apha heitungmaklai angrakip hi kinaleitipi ejei.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akajuosik Miring Sapa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Khawa poongnapha nikhuo thengngachu kani kha aziingsik eii, tha kha-um war nunijei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jo 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Chonglar 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezek 32:7</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />arsi ngaikha marwaan makheiya injuotasik eii, khat-um lairalak-ah kaom ranak rakip intuulsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Chonglar 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jo 2:10</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Khawa phakhan Miring Sapa kha suumphai chungnga akul ara-aang khat-um araatnale inruoiya ijuokha ningmusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Chonglar 1:7</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ama'n marwaan ahekna makheiya nuoipil aheknakhat katung Pathian ikadang mi ngaikha kakhoomchun sik-ah marwaan tirton ngaikha nuopil rakil mili makheiya aheitir sik eii.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang Kuungnga inphut Inchusik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matt 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Theichangkuung diangnga inphut inchuru. Aziik kadoongkha hongcherra khat-um abuo hongsuokjei inchu, nangni'n kholum ahongnaijei tia ningjet. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Hiwa angnga, nangni'n akasuok chuon rakip ningmupha khan, Pumi kha inkharkuung juotungjei ti nangni'n jettaru. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumi kha inkharkuung juotungjei ti nangni'n jettaru; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama kha naijei, kajuosik ah insuukjei.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Inthiangnga kei'n nangni diang kinatipi eii, hiwangai rakip hi asuok maklaiseng hiwa khanghi heknuni. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Marwaan khat-um nuoipilhi alamangsik eii, takkha kei kachong hichu supmangnga mangnuni.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuteii Innum Nikhuo emakli Aphakha jetmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matt 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Khawa nikhuo li aphakha Apa elekleiya, marwaan tirton ngai innun, Asapa innum, tuteii innum jetmu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Matt 24:36</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ensuichakru, Inringru, ajarchu nangni'n aphakha angtik esikme tihi jetmakchu.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Miring inkhat in asuok ngaidiang inthosi chuon apeli, inn kangaakpa diang inringchak inlang omro iti chong apeya, halli inn mathaanna ram kalaaktak-ah khuol-injil kasi ka-ang eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk 12:36-38</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Inringtheiru, ajarchu inn mapupa kha kholei, zaanchim, arkhuong, emakli ziingtiang hongkir sikbe ti jetmakchu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ama'n jetlei theileiya hongduoi innum, ningzaalla ningleiom kha na-intongpui marase. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Inringchakru, Kei'n nangni diang kitihi, mi rakip diang kiti eii!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thatna sik-ah Chuonminsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Chol inchelmak waipool khat-um Rakaanna kahoi nini matiang, Thiampu Kalian khat-um Dan Karu ngai'n ruuk-ah Jisu surli thatnasik lam inlei-entok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Suok 12:1-27</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />“Eini'n kahoi suungngachu thochamak ajarchu mipui inhaangsik eii, inmani'n inleiti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Bethany ah Sariak kanootna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matt 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Bethany makheiya Simon inti apumma kaphar ri kaleiroon miring inkhat innna Jisu'n abak a-inna omlaikhan, numeisa inkhat lungngoi beel kasipchei inthiang nard makheiya insum amankatam sariak choiya aheiwa. Numeisanu khan sariak beelkha amakoiya arim kahoi sariak kha Jisu lu-ah aleibun. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Khanna kaom mi lekkhat in zootmuwa khatli inkhatdiang inlei inti, “hituk-ah arim kahoi sariak hi angsik-ah lailamma iminmang me? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Dangkapum rajathum khella leijoursik kha eii <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dangkapum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enru 6:37.</char></note> halli sialkha sara ngaidiang leipesik eii!” tia inmani ngai'n numeisanu kha setheiya inleirilthai.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Takkha Jisu'n aleiti, “numeisanu imanuomkha thorase; angsik ame ning-enrinchak? ama'n keisikbeiya akatha chuonkha athojei.<verse eid="MRK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Sara ngai khachu nangnile amunle apha rakip-ah ningom suom, nangni'n ningsan zootlitak, inmanichu ningsanthei. Takkha nangnile keichu apha rakip-ah omsuom numin. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Innidan 15:11</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ama'n ithomaneii kha itho ejei; sariak arim kahoi kapumma nakanoot hi kapum inreii nasik-ah apha matiang insuuk ejei. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Tuunchu, Kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kati khachu manmasituol pumpuiya chongkahoi ningril phakhan, numeisanu ileitho rakip hi-um ma ngaidonnale inruoiya ningrilsik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Kajuor sik-ah Judas in azootjei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matt 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Halli Judas Iscariot, asiamruoi soomleini ngai karra kinchel, ama'n Jisu kapesik-ah Thiampu Kalian ngaidiang aleisi. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Inmani'n inleijet phakhan inleirok, amadiang sial napekinte tia chong inlei-inkhit. Halli Judas in Jisu kha inmani diang aphakacha khat-ah pesik-ah aleiminsuuk.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamruoi ngaile Rakaanna Kahoi Bukha inleibak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matt 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Chol inchelmak waipool kahoi mansakhet nikhuo, rakaanna kahoi bubaknasik-ah Keelngamteii thatna nikhuoni, Asiamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inleirakel, “Rakaanna kahoi bubak nasik-ah hun nangsik-ah kaminsuuk nanaminsi zootme?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Jisu'n asiamruoi inni atirra aleitipi: “Khuopui suungnga siru, halli tuibeella tuikachoi miring inkhat in nantongpuite. Ama kha juiru <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />halli ama luutna inn mapupa diang tiru: ‘Karu'n ati, kasiamruoi ngaile Kei rakaanna kahoi bubaknasik innkha hume?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Halli ama'n chungnga insak inn kaloktak nangni diang naminmute, ang rakip kha khawakhan einisik-ah minsuukru.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Asiamruoi ngai'n inmathaanna, khuopuitiang inleisi, halli Jisu itijek angnga inmani'n inlei intongpui; halli inmani'n Rakaanna kahoi bubakna kha inleiminsuuk.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Kholei hei-ephakhan, asiamruoi soomleini ngaikhale Jisu inheiwasuom.<verse eid="MRK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Inmani'n in-ongnga inbak laikhan, Jisu'n aleiti, “Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kanati, ningkarra keile kabaksuom miring inkhat in kei anajuorsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Minpkla 41:9</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Asiamruoi ngai'n malung kadongle inruoiya inkhat suoli inkhat in, “kei ka-ebe?” intia amadiang inleirakel.<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Soomleini ngai karra miring inkhat awaipool keile kheengnga kasunsuompa kha eii. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Pathian chong inthiang khan lei-injia angnga Miring Sapa kha athisik eii; takkha Miring Sapa kajuor amasik achu angtuk-ah rawaan kaseme! Khawa miringkha inleineimak inram akathawiai esik eii!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pumi Zaansaak minsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matt 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Inmani'n inbaklai takkhan, Jisu'n waipool lekkhat aleiya, aleiminthiang, akatherra, asiamruoi ngaidiang aleisemma aleiti. “Bakru” “Hiwahi kei kataksa kha eii.”<figure style="fig" alt="Lord's supper" file="lb00320c.tif" size="span" ref="14:22">Pumi zaansaak minsuuk</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Khawa suoli Jisu'n rabing kha aleiya Pathian diang aniya inmani diang aleipeii; halli inraya-ah inlei insuom.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Hiwahi mipui sik-ah kaluong Pathian le inzootna kathar kei thisen kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Suok 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiril eii, khawa nikhuo Pathian Rengramma akathar theibomju ka-inmaklaiseng Kei'n woikhat inlet-ah hiwa theibomju hi innuningjei.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Khawa suoli inmani'n Pathian minpaakna la kha insaksuoli Olive Chingbungtiang inleisi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter Inlipphir sik jarra Jisu'n aleiril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jisu'n inmani ngaidiang aleiti, “Ningraya-ah kei namathaan ningta ninglataan wiaksik eii, ajarchu Pathian chong inthiang in ati, ‘Pathian in Keelngam kakhaalpa kha athatsik eii, halli Keelngam ngaikha inchaangdar sik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zech 13:7</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Takkha Kei'n kahongringsuo nuk-ah, Kei'n nangni matiang Galilee ah kasisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Matt 28:16</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peter in aleimasang, “Mi rakip in innamathaan ngai suok-innum, kei'n nang supmathaan namathaan nuning!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jisu'n Peter diang aleiti, “Kei'n inthiangnga kati, wini zaantak arkhong in woini hongkhuong ma-ah, nang in kei woithum najetmong natisik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Peter in rasa inringdet-ah aleimasang, “Kei nangle thisuomsik suok-innum, kei'n nangkha zootmak thonuning!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Asiamruoi leiilaak ngai rakip innum khawa jekkha inleiti.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Gethsemane ah Pathian Ini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Inmani'n Gethsemane inti munkhan inleisi, halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Pathian kanisuung seng hin lei-in-ongru.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ama'n Peter, James khat-um John aleiruoi, han rathamor kasiin khat-um malung poongna aleinei, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />khawa phakhan ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Thinasik katungnga kamalunghi apoongjei; inringchak inlang hin leiomru.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Matiang asidetli, neipilla inbok-ah achathei inchu aphakha madiangnga inphut nakhaipiro tia Pathian diang aleini. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ama'n aleiti “Pa Pathian,” emak rakip nangdiangchu ethei eii, hiwa rabinghi keidiang makheiya nakhaipiro, kei lungdou emarase, takkha nang nalungdou kha erase.<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ama'n aheikir phakhan inmani'n inzaalla inleiomkha ajuomu, halli Peter diang aleiti, “Simon, nazaalbe? phadan inkhat bit-um nang harmaneii makchebe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Matheemna khan ningchul maknasik “Inringchak inlang Pathian diang niru. Ratha inchu athozoot, takkha taksa khachu asuol.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Woikhat asirit-ah chinna khale in-angrip chongnga Pathian diang aleininook. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Halli Jisu'n ahongnook-ah inmani'n inleizaalnook kha ahongmu ajarchu inmani inmit leimahar maneiimu, halli inmani ngai'n amadiang masangdan leijetmu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Woithum huuina ama'n aheiwa-ah inmani diang aleiti, “Tuunkatung ningzaalla soong ninglamachumbe? Ahunjei! Aphakha aheitungjei! Entaru, Miring Sapa hi manu karoonngai kutchungnga inpejei. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Intheitru, eini'n situi, Kei kanajuor pakha ahongjei!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Insurna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Jisu'n arilla omlaitak, Upa ngai, Dan Karu-ngai, khat-um Thiampu Kalian ngai hongtir, chem, thal, ramol naangkhuo kachoi mipui ngaile inruoiya, soomleini ngai karra Judas ahongtung. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Kajuorpa ama'n mipui ngaidiang injetna aleipeii: “Kei'n kimazoop ama kha eii, sur inlang kacheet-ah khit-inlang ruoiru.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Judas heitungli heitungmak Jisu diang asiya, “Karu!” tia aleimazoop. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Inmani'n Jisu kha insurra kacheet-ah inleikhit. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Khawa khanna ka-ngirra kaom miring inkhat in achem keisuo ah Thiampu Kalian khetpa suok inkhat akuor aleitukthaak. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Inruup kasursik angnga chem, thal, ramol naangkhuo ningchoiya kei kanasursik ninghongbe?<verse eid="MRK 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Nisuo rakip kei'n Biak-inna kanaminchuwa nangnile kaleiom, khat-um nangni'n nasurmakchu. Takkha Pathian chong-inthiang khachu huui tungmak thamak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Halli asiamruoi ngai rakip in ama inmathaanna inleitaanwiak.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Khawa munkhan linen puonkaneem kasil ruothar inkhat Jisu nuk aleijui. Inmani'n ama kha sursik injuotho, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Takkha apuonsil adeengjuonna aleitaan.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu uparup ngai Maikuungnga.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matt 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luk 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Jn 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Halli Jisu kha Thiampu Kaliankhet inna inleiruoi, Dan Karu-ngai, upa-ngai khat-um Thiampu Kalian ngai kha-um inlei-intuup. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Peter in kalaak-ah Thiampu Kalian khetpa tuollaidung katung aleijui. Suokngai khale in-ong suomma mei alei-oot. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Thiampu Kalian ngai khat-um intuup Uparup rakip ngai'n Jisu thatnasik katung chong kapemaneii inlei entok, takkha tuteii-um leimumu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Mi katamtak in Jisu takchungnga maleisei inleiril, takkha inmani ngai chongkha inkhat-um lei-in-angmak.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Hin intia miring lekkhat in inhongngirra Jisu chungnga maleisei inleiril:<verse eid="MRK 14:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Keini'n ma itikha kinjet, ‘miring kut-ah insak Biak-inn hi kaminmangsik eii, halli nithum suungnga kut-ah insakmak inkhat kasaksik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Inmani ngai khannum, inchongpeii kha leiminruolmu.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Thiampu Kalian khetpa in inmani ngai karra ahongngirra Jisu diang aleirakel, “Inmani ngai'n nang nachungnga chong inrilhi nang iteii-um masangnutinbe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Takkha Jisu'n iteii-um leimasangmak. Inlet-ah Thiampu Kalian khetpa in aleirakelnook, “Rawaan katha Sapa Messiah kha na-ebe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />“Ka eii,” tia Jisu'n aleimasang, “Halli nangni rakip in Miring sapa kha karaat khetpa akut changtiang in-ong khat-um marwaan suumchungnga ijuokha ningmusik eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Thiampu Kalian khetpa in apuon katherra aleiti, “Hanchu eini'n sakhi arei laommabe?<verse eid="MRK 14:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ama'n Pathian irilsekha nangni'n ningjetjei. Angme nangni ningngaidon?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Inmani ngai rakip in amahi kathisik rahoi suok tia inleirilsuok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levi 24:16</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Miring lekkhatchu Jisu kamachilthuon inleiphut, khat-um inmani'n ama kha amit inkhumpiya inleiwuok. “Rilsuokro tume kanawuok kha!” inmani'n inleiti. Khat-um raalmi ngaikhan inleiruoiya ama kha inleikabeen.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu Zootmakna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matt 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Peter kha tuolmur nuoiya tuollaidung khan aleiom phakhan Thiampu Kalian khetpa suokngai karra numeisa inkhat aheiwa; <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Numeisanu khan Peter mei oot-ah i-om amupha khan, amadiang enna aleiti, “Nang-um, na eii, Nazareth Jisu le kalei inruoi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Takkha Peter in inlip phirra aleimasang “Angkeme niti kei jetmong,” halli ama'n suok-ah aleisi. Khawapha takkhan arkhong kha aleikhuong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu inchelmak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khawapha takkhan arkhong kha aleikhuong.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Suok numeisanu in amuriit-ah kangirra kaom mi ngaidiang aleirilnook, “Amahi inmani karra inchel mi inkhat eii!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Takkha ama'n inlip phirnook.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Apha chet tisuo nuk-ah akoolla kangir ngai'n Peter diang inleiti, “Inthiangnga nang inmani ngai karra inkhat na-eii, ajarchu nang-um Galilee makheiya na eii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />“Ama'n chong inkhit-ah khat-um Khomaak insaamma aleiti, kei nangni iril mipahi jettakmong!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Khawapha takkhan arkhong kha'n woini huuina ahongkhuong, halli Jisu'n amadiang ileiril “Arkhong woini hongkhuong ma-ah, nang in woithum keikha najetmong natisik iti chongkha ahongngaidon.” Halli Peter in amalung intooktheiya aleichap.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Pilate Maikuungnga angir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ziingtiang ma-ah Thiampu Kalian ngai'n innottheiya upa ngai, Dan Karu ngai, khat-um uparup ngai khale intuup-ah chong inleiminsuuk. Jisu kha inkhit-ah inleiruoi, halli Pilate diang inleipeii. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilate in Jisu diang aleirakel, “Nang Jihudi ngai Reng kha na-ebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nang itikha ejei.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Thiampu Kalian ngai'n Jisu kha kheella inleirilsiat, <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilate in Jisu diang inlet-ah aleirakel, “Nang namasang nutinbe? Rangairo inmani ngai rakip in nachungnga innarilsehi!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Takkha Jisu'n chongbai inkhat-um leimasang nookmak, khawajarra Pilate in aleingak.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thatnasik-ah Chongtan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matt 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Rakaanna kahoi inthoracham insurra indangai karra mipui imanuom miring inkhat kha Pilate in aleimasuo kachak. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Barabbas inti raalruuk ngaile mikathat miring inkhat mikhumna ah aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mipui'n inhei intuup-ah inleithojol angnga thoritnasik-ah Pilate diang inhongti, <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilate in mipui ngaidiang aleirakel, “Nangni sik-ah Jihudi Rengpa kimasuo ningmanuombe?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Thiampu Kalian ngai'n Jisu injuopena ajarchu inmani ngai'n inleira-ot jarra eii tia Pilate in aleijet.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Takkha Jisu rathuulla Barabbas kha masuonasik Pilate diang tiru tia Thiampu Kalian ngai'n mipui ngaidiang inleimasok. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Mipui ngaidiang inlet-ah Pilate in aleiril, “Halle, nangni'n Jihudi ngai Reng tia ningkoi padiang kei angme ningnamin-thozoot?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Mipui ngai'n inlet-ah inleikheek, “Cross-ah makai inlang thatro!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Takkha Pilate in aleirakel, “Angjarra, ama'n angtak masialna aleithome?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">“Cross-ah makai inlang thatro!” intia inmani'n inringsit-ah inleikheeknook.<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilate in mipui malungkha aleimintaizoot jarra Barabbas kha inmani sik-ah aleimasuo, Halli Jisu kha natheiya aminwuok suoli cross-ah makaili thatnasik-ah aleipeii.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raalmi ngai'n Jisu Inlei Innuipui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matt 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Jn 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Raalmi ngai'n Jisu kha Ramkaroonpa inn tuollaidung suungnga inkeiluut khat-um raalmi rahooi rakip inlei inkoichun. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Inmani'n purple puon inchuol kha Jisu inleiminsooi, raling lukhu kha inboolla ama lu-khan inleiminkhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Halli inmani ngai'n “Jihudi rengpa naringkhuo seirase!” tia chubei inleitho. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Inmani ngai'n Jisu lukha tuoitung pumma inleiwuok, halli ama kha inleimachilthuon, inkinbok-ah chubei inleitho. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Inmani'n in-innuipui suoli, purple puon inchuol kha inliikpiya ama puondiar kha inleiminluknook, halli inmani'n cross-ah makaili thatsik-ah inleiruoi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Cross-ah Inthat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Cyrene makheiya araming Simon inti Alexander li Rufus pa khuopuisuung kaluutsik-ah ram inkhat makheiya kaheiwa miring inkhat insina lamma inmani'n inkintongpui, halli raalmi ngai'n Simon kha Jisu cross kha azootmak pumma inleiminpuut. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Inmani ngai'n Jisu kha Golgotha inti munkhan inleiruoi, khawa tinachu “Luruok reiina mun iti eii.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Khawa khan inmani'n theibomju li myrrh inminchunna ama diang inleipeii, takkha Jisu'n inpimak.<verse eid="MRK 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Halli inmani'n cross-ah inmakaiya ama puondiar kha inmani'n inlei insem, tu-in angkachang puonlek kha achangsikme intia rasi inlei-en. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Minpkla 22:18</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ziingtiang phadan kuo chulpha khan Jisu kha cross-ah inleimakai. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ama enzootmakna jarkha hintia injia: “JIHUDI NGAI RENGPA.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Jisu le inruup inni-um changtiang inkhat weitiang inkhat cross-ah inlei makaisuom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Raalruuk ngaikhale inteelchun suomma, Pathianchong inthiangkha huui mintung.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mi kasi kahong ngai'n inlu inkathuk-ah jakna kaom chongrilkha Jisu diang inleiril: “Oho! Biak-inn kaminmangsik, khat-um nithumma kasakrit sipa! <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Minpkla 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Tuun cross makheiya juochum inlang napumtak insanro!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Khawale in-angrip chongkha Thiampu Kalian khat-um Dan Karu ngai'n Jisu diang indeiiya inlei innuipui, khatli khat inlei-inti, “Ma'n mi ngai khachu akatan, takkha apumtakchu intan matormak! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Christa Israel ngai Rengpa, cross-ah inphut tuun juochumro, halli nijuochum kha kinmuli keini'n na-ngamna kinte!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Halli Jisu le inmakaisuom miring inni ngai-innum amadiang indeiiya inlei innuipui.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Suunchim hong-epha makheiya phadan inthum katung ram rakipkha aleiziing.<verse eid="MRK 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Phadan inthum juochul phakhan Jisu'n <char style="tl">“Eloi, Eloi, lema sabachthani?” </char> tia inringnga akheek-ah aleiti, khachu “Kapathian, Kapathian, angjarra nangin keidiangnga inphut khattiang nina-inletdelme?” tina eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Minpkla 22:1</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Akoolla kangirra kaom Jisu iti kajet mi lekkhat ngai'n inleiti, “Enru, Elijah eii ikoi!”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Miring inkhat in ataanna tuipompuon kha theibomju kathur khan anoomma halli khuoichu ramol morra akathilla Jisu baiya ahongsoonna aleiti, “Ngaakdirui, Elijah ajuo ah cross-ah inphut akeithaakbe eini'n enrui!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Minpkla 69:21</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Halli Jisu'n inringnga akheek-ah arang chatjei.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Biak-inna induong puonkha, achung makheiya anuoikatung lekniya alei-inther. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Suok 26:31-33</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Cross kuungnga ngirra kaleiom raalmi rajakhat ngai Lamkakeipa'n Jisu ithi omchan amupha khan. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:39. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ithi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat inchu hin thoa injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aleikheek ah halli aleithi.</char></note> “Hi miring hi inthiangnga Pathian Sapa eii!” aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kalaak-ah numeisa lekkhat in in-enna inleiom, inmani ngai karra Mary Magdalene, Joses li anaipa James nu Mary, halli Salome inlei eii.<verse eid="MRK 15:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Jisu'n Galilee ah aleiomlaiya inmani'n anuk inleijui khat-um sepa inleitho. Aleiilaak numeisa katamtak-um amale Jerusalemma inheiwa. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Inreiina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Jihudi ngai Sernikhuo madet insuukna nikhuo kholei ejarra, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Arimathea makheiya Joseph, uparup ngai karra kaya kaom, khat-um Pathian Rengram kajuosik kangak, ama'n kachi omleiya Pilate diang asiya Jisu kaluong aleini. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Jisu kha thijei ti aleijet phakhan Pilate in aleingak. Raalmi rajakhat lamkakeipa kha akoiya Jisu athitakbeyei tia aleirakel. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Raalmi rajakhat lamkakeipa chong arangaisuo nuk-ah, Pilate in Joseph diang akaluong kha aleipeii. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Joseph in akaluong kha cross makheiya ajuokeithak, linen puon kaneemma aleikatuomma lung makheiya inkawit thaanna aleireii. Halli lung kalok inkhat amalet-ah thaankha aleikhar. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mary Magdalene khat-um Joseph nu Mary in Jisu kaluong inreiikha inleimu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Ahongringna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matt 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Jihudi ngai sernikhuo thengli Mary Magdalene, James nu Mary, khat-um Salome inmani ngai'n inhongnga Jisu kaluongkha kanootsik-ah sariak arim kahoi inleiracho. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Khuoserni ziingtiang ma-ah, kani hongsuoklim phakhan, inmani'n thaankhan inleisi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4" />Inmani'n insina lamma inkhatli inkhat inlei-inti, “Thaankhar lungkha tu-in einisik-ah namaletpi sikme? Takkha inmani'n inlei-en phakhan lungkha alei-inletsuo kha inleimu. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ajarchu (kaloktak lung alei eii) inmani'n thaankha inleiluut, khawakhan inchuol puonkabang inluk khangdoong inkhat changtiang in-ongnga kaomkha inleimu, halli inmani'n inleingak khat-um inleichi.”<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />“Inlai maru,” Ama'n aleiti. “Kei'n kajet cross-ah inthat Nazareth Jisu kha eii nangni'n ning-entok, ama hin ommakjei ama aleiringjei! Enru, ama inreiina munkha hin eii.<verse eid="MRK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Tuun si-inlang hiwa chonghi Peter le inruoiya asiamruoi ngaidiang jominjetru, ‘nangni matiang ama'n Galilee ah asijei; halli ama'n ileiti angnga sowason mujei ningte.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Matt 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n ininlaiya khat-um kachi'n asip-ah thaan makheiya insuok-ah inleitaan. Ajarchu Inmani'n inleichi heijarra tudiang-um chong leirilmu.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mary Magdalene diang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matt 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jn 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Khuoserni ziingtiang Jisu'n ahongring suoli, ama'n raikhuo sari ileipuut suokpi, Mary Magdalene diang mansakhet-ah alei-inlar. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ama'n asiya Jisu'n inruoipui mi ngaidiang aleirilpi, inmani ngaikha inmalung inwaiya inchap-ah inleiom, <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />takkha Jisu ringjei khat-um Magdalene in kamujei itipikha, inmani'n lei-ngamnamu.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n anuk kajui Innidiang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Hiwa thengnga, Jisu'n miring innidiang khuo lamma insiya inleiom phakhan Meelsuo khat-ah inmani diang alei-inlar. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Inmani'n inkirra aleiilaak mi-ngaidiang inleirilpi, takkha inmani'n lei-ngamnamu.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Siamruoi Soomleikhat diang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Chuon 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Khawa thengnga asiamruoi soomleikhat ngai'n inbak ah inomlaitak khan Jisu'n inmani diang alei-inlar. Inmalung kangar khat-um inngamna insuol jarra inmani kha aleiran, ajarchu ama karing kamu-ngai chong kha-um leileimu.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Manmasituol pumpuiya si-inlang chong kahoihi miring rakipdiang juorilru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Chuon 1:8</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Tu ka-ang in a-ngamna ah baptize katho mi kha ringna amusik eii; tu ka-ang ka-ngamnamak mi khan thina amusik eii. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ka-ngamna mi ngaidiang inlak thomatorna ranak apesik eii: Inmani'n raikhuo ngaikha kei karamingnga inpuutsik eii; Inmani'n chong kathar inrilsik eii; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Inmani'n maruul inmahuum emakli tur in-in innum, inmani diang iteii intook omnuni; inmani'n kana-ngai chungnga inkut induongsik eii, halli akana ngaikha indamsik eii.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Marwaan tiang Inruoina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Chuon 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Pumi Jisu'n inmani diang arilsuoli, ama kha marwaan tiang inruoijei halli Pathian changtiang in-ongjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Chuon 1:9-11</ref></char><verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Asiamruoi ngai'n insiya amun rakip-ah Pathian chong inril, halli Pumi'n inmani ngaikha inruoipuichak, khat-um in-itho chuon inlak ngaikhan inmani chongril ngaikha adik tia amalar] Amen.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>